INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-003-rd003',3,'xml_Parse_project',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.375,17,307,'Section: What This Project Is

xml_Parse_project is a multi-feature C++ desktop application for working with XML documents and social-network data represented in XML.

The repository contains parsing, tree representation, structural correction, pretty printing, minification, XML-to-JSON conversion, Huffman compression/decompression, graph analysis, and a graphical desktop interface.

The project is therefore a substantial step beyond isolated algorithm exercises: several independent transformations and analyses are integrated into one desktop software system.

Section: Project Scope > XML Parsing and Representation

Core files such as parse.cpp, parse.h, tag.cpp, tag.h, Tree.h, Stack.h, and xmlFile.h support tokenization, tag extraction, tree construction, and structured document handling.

Section: Project Scope > XML Formatting and Conversion

The XML_File logic supports:

aligned / pretty-printed XML;

minified XML;

recursive structural traversal;

XML-to-JSON conversion;

repeated-child detection for JSON array representation.

Section: Project Scope > XML Error Detection and Correction

correction.cpp / correction.h expose structural error detection, line/tag information, and corrected-tree generation.

The inspected header attributes this subsystem to Nada Yousef and Nada Amgad.

Section: Project Scope > Compression and Decompression

The repository contains Huffman-tree structures, min-heap logic, frequency counting, code construction, bit-level output, and tree-guided decompression.

Section: Project Scope > Social Graph Analysis

network.* and SocialGraph.* model follower/following relationships and expose queries for:

most influential user;

most active user;

mutual followers;

follower-of-follower suggestions.

SocialGraph.h explicitly attributes this area to Hussam Eldin Wael.

Section: Project Scope > Desktop GUI

The GUI layer includes:

Qt-style .ui files;

a main window;

fix/error dialogs;

help/about windows;

syntax-highlighting components.

Section: Technical Stack > C++

C++ is used for file I/O, strings, vectors, classes, pointers, recursive traversal, graph structures, heap/tree algorithms, and bit-level compression.

Section: Technical Stack > Qt-Style Desktop UI

The presence of .ui files and corresponding C++ window/dialog classes provides strong repository-level evidence of Qt-style desktop application development.

Section: Technical Stack > XML

XML is the primary input format and the main processing domain.','["syntax-highlighting","xml-to-json","min-heap","scope","parsing","representation","formatting","conversion","error","detection","correction","compression","decompression","social","graph","desktop","technical","stack","qt-style"]','["What This Project Is","Project Scope","Technical Stack"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-003-s004-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s004","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-003-xml_Parse_project/README.md","source_line_end":40,"source_line_start":40,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`xml_Parse_project` is a multi-feature C++ desktop application for working with XML documents and social-network data represented in XML.","text_sha256":"d399fa32089f66bb64dd71371e42deef52ffb4de0dc556e6757d32c072a038fc","unit_id":"s004","word_count":18},{"block_id":"repo-003-s004-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s004","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-003-xml_Parse_project/README.md","source_line_end":42,"source_line_start":42,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository contains parsing, tree representation, structural correction, pretty printing, minification, XML-to-JSON conversion, Huffman compression/decompression, graph analysis, and a graphical desktop interface.","text_sha256":"8704fd6c87578ee8cb235c560c20696d0b7ef94cf199e04f1aca1b422ef0b670","unit_id":"s004","word_count":22},{"block_id":"repo-003-s004-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s004","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"reposito