INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-008-rd006',8,'SedraAssembler',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3769,14,305,'Section: Major Engineering Work > Error Categorization

instruction-width violation;

duplicate start;

duplicate end;

register incompatibility.

This is strong positive evidence of defensive validation rather than a single generic failure path.

Section: Major Engineering Work > Machine-Code Encoding

Validated instructions are mapped to visible six-bit opcode prefixes:

addar → 000000;

subar → 000001;

addlog → 000010;

mullog → 000011.

Register operands are converted to three-bit binary values and concatenated with the opcode into instruction bitstrings.

Section: Major Engineering Work > Syntax Highlighting

EasyRichText patterns provide lightweight source highlighting for session keywords, processor identifiers, and supported mnemonics.

Section: Major Engineering Work > Clipboard Export

Both assembler output and memory-map output can be copied through Flutter''s clipboard API, with Snackbars confirming the action.

Section: Major Engineering Work > Memory Mapping

RamPage maintains eight integer values.

On input changes, values are parsed, stored, converted to 16-bit binary strings, and combined into an exportable mapping.

Section: Cross-Platform Project Structure

The repository contains Flutter''s Android and iOS project structures.

The checked-in app-release.apk is concrete evidence that the Android target reached a packaged release artifact.

Section: Engineering Practices > Explicit Grammar Rules

The assembly language has clearly encoded structural invariants.

Section: Engineering Practices > Validation Before Encoding

Machine output is produced only after the parser-like checks succeed.

Section: Engineering Practices > Error Categorization

Different syntax and consistency problems receive specific diagnostic messages.

Section: Engineering Practices > Workflow Separation

Assembler editing and memory mapping are exposed as distinct application screens.

Section: Engineering Practices > Static Linting

The repository includes Flutter''s lint configuration.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Languages and Frameworks

Dart — strong evidence.
Flutter — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Mobile Application Development

Widget composition — strong evidence.

Navigation — strong evidence.

Stateful screens — strong evidence.

Text-field interaction — strong evidence.

Material UI — strong evidence.

Asset use — strong evidence.','["dart","flutter","navigation","major","engineering","work","error","categorization","machine-code","encoding","syntax","highlighting","clipboard","export","memory","mapping","cross-platform","structure","practices","grammar","rules","validation","before","workflow"]','["Major Engineering Work","Cross-Platform Project Structure","Engineering Practices","Skills Demonstrated"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-008-s025-b007","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s025","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Error Categorization"],"section_title":"Error Categorization","source_file":"repositories/repo-008-SedraAssembler/README.md","source_line_end":175,"source_line_start":175,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- instruction-width violation;","text_sha256":"1870bd86079d7ab28a0c1cfae475e32bb97c620b4b1cc34c610bb92205d11e8c","unit_id":"s025","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-008-s025-b008","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s025","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Error Categorization"],"section_title":"Error Categorization","source_file":"repositories/repo-008-SedraAssembler/README.md","source_line_end":176,"source_line_start":176,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- duplicate start;","text_sha256":"94900994879db42be1b047cd4891decd0c5ce7cacf78f18fafae9e5f9a31c6e7","unit_id":"s025","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-008-s025-b009","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s025","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Error Categorization"],"section_title":"Error Categorization","source_file":"repositories/repo-008-SedraAssembler/README.md","source_line_end":177,"source_line_start":177,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- duplicate end;","text_sha256":"48b7cddff3d30dfcfd047baecf9e7d7fe9e5aad101e