itory-level Flutter lint configuration.","text_sha256":"c61c60063cc30784682ad303eb3b09f0f030952fe00c32e4db718e88b1f50768","unit_id":"s053","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-008-s054-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s054","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-008-SedraAssembler/README.md","source_line_end":354,"source_line_start":354,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`SedraAssembler` is an early convergence project in the portfolio.","text_sha256":"a6a054d21a2a60e187e065b97ca720ad9be17ae0c5cfc63fb95d683fa5b4595d","unit_id":"s054","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-008-s054-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s054","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-008-SedraAssembler/README.md","source_line_end":356,"source_line_start":356,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It marks the transition from studying processors to building an installable software tool around a processor architecture, and it establishes the first observed Flutter/Dart mobile-development evidence.","text_sha256":"423fb4530743b0c44f488426d121d5c41ea3537d48db6419b86ebca90846829f","unit_id":"s054","word_count":26},{"block_id":"repo-008-s055-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s055","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-008-SedraAssembler/README.md","source_line_end":360,"source_line_start":360,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`SedraAssembler` is a Flutter developer utility for writing and assembling a small custom instruction language and generating processor memory mappings.","text_sha256":"4d4bc66b2f0329620b0abd5048b5ecff4aec106820dc572ff08877b1341ee17e","unit_id":"s055","word_count":20},{"block_id":"repo-008-s055-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s055","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-008-SedraAssembler/README.md","source_line_end":362,"source_line_start":362,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its most important engineering characteristic is a validation-first pipeline: source text is normalized, checked for session boundaries and fixed-width instruction structure, validated for processor/register consistency, and then converted into bit-level output.","text_sha256":"0c4084824db88b0761dfe45ea7fcd3a6b1c4bb6059a231e9ae56b0c566c99857","unit_id":"s055","word_count":31},{"block_id":"repo-008-s055-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s055","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-008-SedraAssembler/README.md","source_line_end":364,"source_line_start":364,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The project combines mobile UI engineering with low-level computer-architecture reasoning and reaches a packaged Android artifact.","text_sha256":"46f64228a8c039e53ff9c765ef95128669be4c60a363af00140c2f14b174dadc","unit_id":"s055","word_count":16},{"block_id":"repo-008-s056-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s056","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-008-SedraAssembler/README.md","source_line_end":370,"source_line_start":370,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `mobile-application`","text_sha25