INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-011-rd005',11,'Structural-Design-Patterns',NULL,NULL,'direct_evidence','implementation_skills','positive','implemented_or_concrete',0.5689,8,58,'Section: Bridge Pattern > Implementation hierarchy

Device;

Tv;

Radio.

RemoteControl delegates power, volume, and channel operations to a Device.

AdvancedRemoteControl adds a mute operation while remaining connected to the device abstraction.

The same control abstraction can therefore operate over different device implementations.

Section: Scale and Complexity > Implementation Scale

