INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-013-rd004',13,'Pipelined-MIPS-UVM-Based-Verification',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','deployment_operations','neutral','interpretive',0.3469,10,145,'Section: Pipeline Stage Representation

The design defines a PIPELINE_STAGE enum:

IF_STAGE;

ID_STAGE;

EX_STAGE;

MEM_STAGE;

WB_STAGE.

A stage variable advances through the five stages.

This makes pipeline phase state explicit and typed.

Section: Pipeline Registers

Dedicated structs represent inter-stage state.

Section: Pipeline Registers > IF/ID

Carries:

program counter;
instruction.

Section: Pipeline Registers > ID/EX

Carries fields including:

ALU operation selector;

opcode;

rs;

rt;

rd;

destination register;

shift amount;

function code;

immediate;

program counter;

source register data;

write-data selection;

ALU result field.

Section: Pipeline Registers > EX/MEM

Carries:

ALU operands/results;

shift;

program counter;

rt data;

memory data;

destination register;

write-data selection.

Section: Pipeline Registers > MEM/WB

Carries:

memory data;

ALU result;

program counter;

destination register;

write-data selection.

These explicit inter-stage structures are the core architectural feature of the repository.

Section: Engineering Practices > Pipeline Decomposition

Instruction processing is separated into fetch, decode, execute, memory, and write-back responsibilities.','["pipeline","stage","representation","registers","if/id","id/ex","ex/mem","mem/wb","engineering","practices","decomposition"]','["Pipeline Stage Representation","Pipeline Registers","Engineering Practices"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-013-s009-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s009","section_path":["Pipeline Stage Representation"],"section_title":"Pipeline Stage Representation","source_file":"repositories/repo-013-Pipelined-MIPS-UVM-Based-Verification/README.md","source_line_end":102,"source_line_start":102,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"The design defines a `PIPELINE_STAGE` enum:","text_sha256":"7acc653b6d4a65fb8f38f2bfd92e3f99430be39a45c6017b9f08353552e60024","unit_id":"s009","word_count":6},{"block_id":"repo-013-s009-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s009","section_path":["Pipeline Stage Representation"],"section_title":"Pipeline Stage Representation","source_file":"repositories/repo-013-Pipelined-MIPS-UVM-Based-Verification/README.md","source_line_end":104,"source_line_start":104,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `IF_STAGE`;","text_sha256":"00d2b5c198f3d453268a16b667f6d5bcadccd3f5627eef89b309913084d955f1","unit_id":"s009","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-013-s009-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s009","section_path":["Pipeline Stage Representation"],"section_title":"Pipeline Stage Representation","source_file":"repositories/repo-013-Pipelined-MIPS-UVM-Based-Verification/README.md","source_line_end":105,"source_line_start":105,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `ID_STAGE`;","text_sha256":"48ec6e0e04ac38d3fe89a7e81618874ecd2030a65ff1006955045a6c9c903819","unit_id":"s009","