d-Verification/README.md","source_line_end":364,"source_line_start":364,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This repository marks the point where the portfolio''s computer-architecture work becomes explicitly pipelined and adopts SystemVerilog language features designed for clearer hardware modeling.","text_sha256":"c2ee165a9e61812016969a36bc9659205aa3abe8ad3018fda36865c71c896697","unit_id":"s042","word_count":23},{"block_id":"repo-013-s043-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s043","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-013-Pipelined-MIPS-UVM-Based-Verification/README.md","source_line_end":370,"source_line_start":370,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Pipelined-MIPS-UVM-Based-Verification` contains a personally authored SystemVerilog five-stage MIPS-style pipeline.","text_sha256":"1c3f9768ec4553c2f6ae74628ba90bde86bf1fb19510b3f3bcbfe6d6d7dd455c","unit_id":"s043","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-013-s043-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s043","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-013-Pipelined-MIPS-UVM-Based-Verification/README.md","source_line_end":372,"source_line_start":372,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The design represents stage identity with an enum, carries state across IF/ID, ID/EX, EX/MEM, and MEM/WB structs, initializes program/data/register memories, performs instruction decode and ALU work, accesses data memory, and writes results back to the register file. A clock module and testbench make the model executable in simulation.","text_sha256":"87c535f4e27d46cfe85933c10a0f1dc4e605a89e2576e405c64a3f7ae318a5ea","unit_id":"s043","word_count":4