The repository history is owner-authored and consists of repeated README updates across multiple years.

This is a GitHub profile repository rather than an implementation project, so the strongest evidence is about developer self-presentation and profile-maintenance practices.

The technology icon list is explicitly a self-presented familiarity list. Implementation-backed evidence for those technologies comes from the corresponding software repositories in the corpus.

Section: Evidence Basis

The current tree contains a single README.md.

The README uses Markdown and embedded HTML together with several external dynamic image services.

Section: Collaboration and Authorship

