INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-014-rd003',14,'kirolossedra',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3248,10,332,'Section: What This Repository Is

kirolossedra is the special same-name repository GitHub renders as the account''s public profile README.

Its purpose is identity and technical self-presentation rather than application execution.

The page includes:

a greeting;

animated name text;

profile-view tracking;

a short engineering identity statement;

a technology familiarity icon strip;

GitHub streak statistics.

Section: Technical Elements > Markdown

Markdown provides the document structure and headings.

Section: Technical Elements > Dynamic Typing SVG

readme-typing-svg.demolab.com renders an animated typing effect for the displayed name.

Section: Technical Elements > Profile View Counter

A Komarev badge endpoint renders a profile-view count.

Section: Technical Elements > GitHub Streak Statistics

github-readme-streak-stats.herokuapp.com generates a dynamic contribution-streak image.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Developer Profile Presentation

GitHub profile README configuration — strong evidence.

Markdown — strong evidence.

HTML embedded in Markdown — strong evidence.

External badge/image integration — strong evidence.

Visual developer branding — moderate evidence.

Longitudinal profile maintenance — strong evidence.

Section: Evidence Boundary for Technology Icons

The skill icon strip names many technologies.

Within this repository, that is evidence of self-presented familiarity.

The portfolio corpus uses code/configuration evidence from other repositories when answering implementation questions about those technologies.

That distinction preserves the value of the profile without turning a badge list into implementation evidence.

Section: Capability Developed

Earlier repositories primarily preserve project code. Here, the GitHub account itself becomes intentionally presented through a persistent, curated README.

Section: Historical Significance

kirolossedra provides a useful non-code signal in the chronology: by early 2023, the GitHub presence itself was being treated as a portfolio surface.

Its later updates show that the public technical identity continued to be revised as the underlying project portfolio evolved.

Section: Overall Repository Narrative

kirolossedra is the account''s GitHub profile README repository.

It combines Markdown, embedded HTML, animated SVG text, profile-view tracking, a technology-icon strip, and dynamic contribution statistics into a compact public developer profile. The repository is personally maintained over several years, making it evidence of portfolio curation and technical self-presentation rather than a software implementation project.','["markdown","typing-svg","technical","elements","dynamic","typing","profile","view","counter","github","streak","statistics","skills","demonstrated","developer","presentation","boundary","technology","icons","capability","developed","historical","significance","narrative"]','["What This Repository Is","Technical Elements","Skills Demonstrated","Evidence Boundary for Technology Icons","Capability Developed","Historical Significance","Overall Repository Narrative"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-014-s004-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s004","section_path":["What This Repository Is"],"section_title":"What This Repository Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-014-kirolossedra/README.md","source_line_end":33,"source_line_start":33,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`kirolossedra` is the special same-name repository GitHub renders as the account''s public profile README.","text_sha256":"2de98cb62d28619bdbdcdb4eff0940fa8d7e2b319172917a84de3dddc8fc0209","unit_id":"s004","word_count":14},{"block_id":"repo-014-s004-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s004","section_path":["What This Repository Is"],"section_title":"What This Repository Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-014-kirolossedra/README.md","source_line_end":35,"source_line_start":35,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its purpose is identity and technical self-presentation rather than application execution.","text_sha256":"0aa38c4b09610fd89649d97344e2c75c23bb89655d54f422575892be5cc