The repository contains four C++/header files.

Section: Scale and Complexity > Protocol Complexity

The central complexity comes from maintaining multiple pieces of state consistently:

sender window;

receiver expectation;

sequence wrap-around;

acknowledgements;

buffered packets;

timeout recovery.

Section: Scale and Complexity > Simulation Complexity

