,"source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":176,"source_line_start":176,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It also introduces a small collection-backed subscription list through `ArrayList<Observer>`.","text_sha256":"ea2309b863b8df2c72a01b9f81d6ee83f30c3884c555f06409936c34ba5aed88","unit_id":"s012","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-018-s013-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s013","section_path":["State"],"section_title":"State","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":180,"source_line_start":180,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The State example defines a `State` interface with `doAction(Context)`.","text_sha256":"bb4f0cdd6e3f233144197fa47fc44eaf19e31421c5748dc5e7ff9f11df8c4189","unit_id":"s013","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-018-s013-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s013","section_path":["State"],"section_title":"State","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":182,"source_line_start":182,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"Concrete states include:","text_sha256":"54e3f636c52da3b90a322f42b117d7cbd2e15bdce96fcda48a34ee503ab50931","unit_id":"s013","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-018-s013-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s013","section_path":["State"],"section_title":"State","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":185,"source_line_start":184,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `StartState`;\n- `StopState`.","text_sha256":"ff50478ca02b549646ba1b1a7e7c80f4fce9dbbad4440bf705b662a36e3cae93","unit_id":"s013","word_count":4},{"block_id":"repo-018-s013-b0