ng evidence.**\n- **Compiled Java artifacts — strong evidence.**","text_sha256":"72cfe71311bf1238936e70c93dbe9d477cbb6147223241eef71be1032bc739a2","unit_id":"s029","word_count":14},{"block_id":"repo-018-s030-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s030","section_path":["Capability Developed"],"section_title":"Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":320,"source_line_start":320,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This repository develops the ability to recognize recurring collaboration problems and represent them with explicit object relationships.","text_sha256":"01a6b528203a90641d4b0afdac9687b23ebfde89ac1ee84f7c93615fc336d1d1","unit_id":"s030","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-018-s030-b006","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s030","section_path":["Capability Developed"],"section_title":"Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":327,"source_line_start":327,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"- subscribers can react to state changes;","text_sha256":"597bdbc174feb015ccd064faa7606343966453cd32c36fb1e5d22a6a360c2cb0","unit_id":"s030","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-018-s030-b010","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s030","section_path":["Capability Developed"],"section_title":"Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":332,"source_line_start":332,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The practical learning value is therefore not only memorizing pattern names, but seeing how interfaces, inheritance, composition, and delegation produce different runtime collaboration structures.","text_sha256":"058d95b9bce520e7515d7f100b905426b00b08d9743b5ccb2b11588a3bd0ea11","unit_id":"s030","word_count":24},{"block_id":"repo-018-s031-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s031","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":338,"source_line_start":338,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Within the processed corpus, it is the earliest observed repository centered specifically on behavioral GoF-style patterns.","text_sha256":"916f29ead395f94f72d4a15794d1eccae031987b9c766e66cc5e19ce5e5155d5","unit_id":"s031","word_count":16},{"block_id":"repo-018-s032-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s032","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":352,"source_line_start":352,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Together with the adjacent Creational and Structural pattern repositories, this project records a concentrated object-oriented design-learning phase in early 2023.","text_sha256":"6b13d45a13e43e9d6697eb40459a382721d92656038525807e5dc2578bf92c68","unit_id":"s032","word_count":20},{"block_id":"repo-018-s032-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s032","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":354,"source_line_start":354,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The sequence broadens Java usage from application/problem implementations into explicit study of reusable software-design vocabulary.","text_sha256":"cb43b537e5b2d4344b95fe24f3dfd870c788b23016347c9f374b990735710a1b","unit_id":"s032","word_count":15},{"block_id":"repo-018-s033-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":5,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s033","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":358,"source_line_start":358,"specificity_score":0.78,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Behavioral-Design-Patterns` is a personally attributable Java learning repository made of independent Maven examples for seven implemented behavioral patterns.","text_sha256":"04d296fd094986d91b36123f7f55fb9e57ed30b57d3ee74cb8e998f7f287bb69","unit_id":"s033","word_count":18},{"block_id":"repo-018-s033-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s033","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":360,"source_line_start":360,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The examples explore request delegation, mediated coordination, state snapshots, one-to-many notifications, explicit state objects, interchangeable algorithms, and template-controlled execution. Compiled Maven outputs provide direct evidence that the examples were built. A Visitor-named project exists only as a placeholder and is deliberately excluded from the implemented-pattern evidence.","text_sha256":"fb12fd4e69ccdbbf26dcb5b4664ec9789949b061e7aca03c2e79c34cd770ad01","unit_id":"s033","word_count":46},{"block_id":"repo-018-s033-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s033","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":362,"source_line_start":362,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository''s strongest corpus value is its explicit, code-backed study of runtime object collaboration and behavioral decoupling.","text_sha256":"1486f732666751c45b4e51cc601d1a8b935afcb0a77ef833019daa3f423f48d5","unit_id":"s033","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-018-s034-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s034","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":368,"source_line_start":368,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `design-pattern-learning`","text_sha256":"cc8310d65b7c65721f58b122b8c16565c8653df995b8c3fe9da50771361654d6","unit_id":"s034","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-018-s034-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s034","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":369,"source_line_start":369,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `educational-project`","text_sha256":"7dc4bf2281ead406d942e056061b30679185c3693b783a3b3016476080553510","unit_id":"s034","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-018-s034-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s034","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-018-Behavioral-Design-Patterns/README.md","source_line_end":370,"source_line_start":370,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `behavioral-pattern-exercises`","text_sha256":"c0dce326e85d71b2e21c4f80079d5a5bfdde678713e4af9e21ffb1b