INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-019-rd007',19,'RADAR-Experiement-SENSOR-FUSION-TEAM',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','performance_scale','positive','repository_specific',0.3546,3,103,'Section: Scale and Complexity > Repository Scale

This is a large artifact-heavy repository, with tens of megabytes of simulation assets rather than a small source-only exercise.

Section: Scale and Complexity > Integration Scale

The repository spans:

radar sensing;

simulation world configuration;

MATLAB/Simulink;

ROS messaging;

sensor assignments;

plugin/federate configuration;

cross-team autonomous-vehicle integration.

Section: Scale and Complexity > Data-Model Complexity

A single radar detection exposes range, velocity, three-axis velocity decomposition, angular position, identity, power loss, and incidence-angle information.

