INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-020-rd005',20,'Sedra-Platformer-Game',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3545,10,229,'Section: Keyboard Input

On key release, it becomes false.

The input layer therefore tracks sustained movement rather than treating each key press as one fixed displacement.

Section: Mouse Input

Mouse implements both:

MouseListener;
MouseMotionListener.

A left-button click sets the protagonist''s attack flag.

This gives the prototype simultaneous keyboard navigation and mouse-triggered action input.

Section: Protagonist State

Protagonist extends the repository''s Character abstraction.

Its runtime state includes:

X/Y position;

speed;

movement flags;

attack flag;

current animation;

animation timer;

animation frame selector;

sprite animation grid.

Section: Movement Logic

alterPosition() updates the player position according to active directional flags.

Opposing directions are explicitly checked so left/right and up/down conflict behavior is controlled.

The method also calculates whether the protagonist is currently moving.

That movement state influences animation selection.

Section: Animation State Selection

alterAnimation() switches between at least:

running;

idle;

attack.

Attack state overrides ordinary movement/idle selection.

When the selected animation changes, frame counters are reset so the new animation begins cleanly.

Section: Animation Timing

refreshAnimation() increments an animation timer.

After the configured refresh interval, the frame selector advances.

When the frame count for the active animation is exhausted, the selector wraps back to zero.

Attack completion also clears the attack flag after the animation cycle.

This is concrete frame-sequencing logic rather than a single static sprite draw.

Section: Sprite-Sheet Processing

formAnimations() loads /main.png and slices it into subimages through repeated BufferedImage.getSubimage() calls.','["prototype","keyboard","input","mouse","protagonist","state","movement","logic","animation","selection","timing","sprite-sheet","processing"]','["Keyboard Input","Mouse Input","Protagonist State","Movement Logic","Animation State Selection","Animation Timing","Sprite-Sheet Processing"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-020-s015-b008","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s015","section_path":["Keyboard Input"],"section_title":"Keyboard Input","source_file":"repositories/repo-020-Sedra-Platformer-Game/README.md","source_line_end":150,"source_line_start":150,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"On key release, it becomes false.","text_sha256":"bac894be5a2d0259d9e50cbb5dffff8f6bd682fac4f6c8f9255c60af5839cff3","unit_id":"s015","word_count":6},{"block_id":"repo-020-s015-b009","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s015","section_path":["Keyboard Input"],"section_title":"Keyboard Input","source_file":"repositories/repo-020-Sedra-Platformer-Game/README.md","source_line_end":152,"source_line_start":152,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The input layer therefore tracks sustained movement rather than treating each key press as one fixed displacement.","text_sha256":"7a7e260ff90c7028a9bb96ab400bf4c961b7aad3edb78074e27c7ee4e0da2d6e","unit_id":"s015","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-020-s016-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s016","section_path":["Mouse Input"],"section_title":"Mouse Input","source_file":"repositories/repo-020-Sedra-Platformer-Game/README.md","source_line_end":156,"source_line_start":156,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"`Mouse` implements both:","text_sha256":"7bf2f9420c3dabd01e94d580b974b