PCL is used for:

voxel-grid filtering;

crop boxes;

index extraction;

SAC/RANSAC plane segmentation;

KD-tree search;

Euclidean cluster extraction;

min/max 3D bounding-box calculation;

PCD I/O;

3D visualization.

Section: Engineering Practices > Pipeline Decomposition

Point-cloud processing is separated into named operations:

filtering;

separation;

segmentation;

clustering;

bounding boxes;

