,{"block_id":"repo-028-s026-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Capability Developed"],"section_title":"Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":277,"source_line_start":277,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Rather than only using classes and interfaces, it uses Java’s metadata model to write behavior that adapts to arbitrary target classes.","text_sha256":"0c251ae580cc4d6250314896c56739bbff8cb62cc36513a2a9b6ccfd84f8b01f","unit_id":"s026","word_count":21},{"block_id":"repo-028-s026-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Capability Developed"],"section_title":"Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":279,"source_line_start":279,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"That is relevant to later work involving frameworks, serialization, dependency injection, ORMs, and reflective infrastructure because those systems use related runtime concepts.","text_sha256":"7c6dbcfe407a2186fbe30427dfdf2aff764b691ba2a470707b3a6a6963e947da","unit_id":"s026","word_count":22},{"block_id":"repo-028-s027-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s027","section_path":["Historical Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":283,"source_line_start":283,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This is the earliest processed repository centered specifically on Java reflection.","text_sha256":"1abdac5b091282c7d70f3db0294c62f680c7212f661ce754b48defafbc16c76d","unit_id":"s027","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-028-s027-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s027","section_path":["Historical Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":285,"source_line_start":285,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It is also the earliest processed repository that implements custom XML-to-object and JSON-to-object data binding through reflection.","text_sha256":"48e8b34c1d4bdda8fade10628dc7e3b5b0136e8f40004f55a65f601fe082ecdd","unit_id":"s027","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-028-s027-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s027","section_path":["Historical Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":287,"source_line_start":287,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The project therefore adds a new Java capability layer beyond the earlier design-pattern exercises.","text_sha256":"bd5b40a4ea71d38f2bedbdc7ac0caac25d24c0da839f1816c58f8091e004c2dd","unit_id":"s027","word_count":14},{"block_id":"repo-028-s028-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s028","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":291,"source_line_start":291,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`JavaLibrary` is a compact experiment in building a lightweight serialization mapper.","text_sha256":"768d907150caed1362063dc2f30806ee39aeff05e165bb2606904d42d197b5c2","unit_id":"s028","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-028-s028-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s028","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":293,"source_line_start":293,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its significance is not the amount of code.","text_sha256":"df04eb32cd39a1b40e4f4e804a86b8c13a38b4f372b3fe1549df8b0f91cfcbf5","unit_id":"s028","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-028-s028-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s028","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":295,"source_line_start":295,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It is the shift in abstraction level.","text_sha256":"fa08b30c2f3ac8d019e9a8d075c8960f429a8bb0e5862389f5e047447d9d1873","unit_id":"s028","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-028-s028-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s028","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":297,"source_line_start":297,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The implementation stops treating XML and JSON parsing as one-off field extraction and instead asks a reusable question:","text_sha256":"ef3b7a38ad380468536042200fa85feae30c9623f01bf18f2460ed1bff9d0b9d","unit_id":"s028","word_count":18},{"block_id":"repo-028-s028-b005","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s028","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":299,"source_line_start":299,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"> Given a target Java class, can external fields be mapped into that class automatically?","text_sha256":"a0a38414c9f29ecb593293fe0b85597959233dc7c34a91d6fe726b95c005c99e","unit_id":"s028","word_count":15},{"block_id":"repo-028-s028-b006","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s028","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":301,"source_line_start":301,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The answer is implemented using generics, reflection, runtime construction and typed assignment.","text_sha256":"e5442ebb0bc89bbbaf7cfc41da1a64b3a884af9971527bad8931d868a53abe46","unit_id":"s028","word_count":12},{"block_id":"repo-028-s028-b007","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s028","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","source_line_end":303,"source_line_start":303,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"That makes the repository a clear early example of framework-like thinking inside the portfolio.","text_sha256":"92a51137d742099655c680a5fa8a52d13610e3f582a0249a186fb5597896a16b","unit_id":"s028","word_count":14}]','{"analysis_source_file":"repositories/repo-028-JavaLibrary/README.md","document_text_sha256":"a1e774e111f0bdeb7bc5b1fb680acc1db77819c64cc2091c022f87ba8b635db4","earliest_source_line":246,"embedding_text_sha256":"226f59c37612c2c399cff4e80cb9458985e068c88e15e414a74754df585e5e28","normalized_input":"rag-corpus/repositories.jsonl","repository_raw_sha256":"4d2b19287ec00262d58dde4f963fb9590ec3d1998640009086b8bf9fb1d893ee","repository_source_line_end":328,"repository_source_line_start":1}');
