Repository commits are owner-attributed and show the owner repeatedly uploading, organizing and renaming the lab artifacts.

The small TTC notebooks expose their implementation directly and are therefore strong evidence of hands-on Python perception work.

Two much larger notebooks are also present for feature tracking and lidar/object detection.

Because those multi-megabyte notebooks cannot be completely exposed through the repository connector, this README treats their names and surrounding data as positive scope evidence without manufacturing detailed algorithm claims from filenames alone.','["python","lidar","collaboration","authorship","context"]','["Collaboration and Authorship Context"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-029-s002-b001","canonical_categories":["authorship_attribution"],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s002","section_path":["Collaboration and Authorship Context"],"section_title":"Collaboration and Authorship Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-029-Camera/README.md","source_line_end":16,"source_line_start":16,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Repository commits are owner-attributed and show the owner repeatedly uploading, organizing and renaming the lab artifacts.","text_sha256":"0a8de1b82690e7fd44507ff489cc684eacea0ee42810770ce60cf27dc7a60996","unit_id":"s002","word_count":16},{"block_id":"repo-029-s002-b002","canonical_categories":["authorship_attribution"],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s002","section_path":["Collaboration and Authorship Context"],"section_title":"Collaboration and Authorship Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-029-Camera/README.md","source_line_end":18,"source_line_start":18,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The small TTC notebooks expose their implementation directly and are therefore strong evidence of hands-on Python perception work.","text_sha256":"582ce34ec50093a8dfe23aaa0f83a1dde0e6889b3b5355e681a04813b4edbd44","unit_id":"s002","word_count":18},{"block_id":"repo-029-s002-b003","canonical_categories":["authorship_attribution"],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s002","section_path":["Collaboration and Authorship Context"],"section_title":"Collaboration and Authorship