INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-031-rd003',31,'TestAnimation',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3932,23,260,'Section: What This Project Is

TestAnimation is a small browser experiment for scroll-triggered reveal animation.

Those sections begin with the CSS class .hidden.

JavaScript observes their visibility relative to the viewport.

As sections enter or leave the viewport, a .show class is dynamically added or removed.

Section: Project Structure

Each file has a single clear responsibility:

HTML defines sections,

CSS defines presentation and reveal state,

JavaScript detects viewport intersection.

Section: Scroll-Reveal State

The CSS defines two presentation states.

Section: Scroll-Reveal State > Hidden

opacity: 0
transition: all 1s

Section: Scroll-Reveal State > Show

opacity: 1

JavaScript controls only the semantic visibility class.

CSS owns the animation itself.

That creates a simple separation between:

visibility detection,
visual transition.

Section: Page Layout

Each section is configured as a grid.

It uses:

display: grid,

place-items: center,

align-content: center,

min-height: 100vh.

As a result, each reveal target occupies at least one viewport height and centers its content.

That layout makes the intersection behavior easy to observe while scrolling.

Section: Typography

The project imports Poppins from Google Fonts.

Several font weights are requested.

The body applies Poppins as the primary font.

Section: GitHub Pages

Repository metadata shows GitHub Pages enabled.

That turns the experiment into a deployable browser artifact rather than only local source.

Section: Engineering Practices > Separation of Concerns

The three-file structure cleanly separates:

markup,

styling,

runtime behavior.

Section: Engineering Practices > State via CSS Classes

JavaScript mutates class state while CSS determines presentation.

Section: Engineering Practices > Focused Iteration

The commit sequence shows repeated refinement of app.js during the same short experiment.','["html","javascript","structure","scroll-reveal","state","hidden","show","page","layout","typography","github","pages","engineering","practices","separation","concerns","classes","focused","iteration"]','["What This Project Is","Project Structure","Scroll-Reveal State","Page Layout","Typography","GitHub Pages","Engineering Practices"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-031-s003-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-031-TestAnimation/README.md","source_line_end":24,"source_line_start":24,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`TestAnimation` is a small browser experiment for scroll-triggered reveal animation.","text_sha256":"e677b2c8e4313cfc7730f218ce788a758081c990d7aafe726b359b7aa68dfa41","unit_id":"s003","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-031-s003-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-031-TestAnimation/README.md","source_line_end":28,"source_line_start":28,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Those sections begin with the CSS class `.hidden`.","text_sha256":"aff33af01b23de3e092d69b656794a87493c4728c4cb91021ec540e6ef757efd","unit_id":"s003","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-031-s003-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-031-TestAnimation/README.md","source_line_end":30,"source_line_start":30,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"JavaScript obser