el":"repository_specific","section_id":"s009","section_path":["Hardware Abstraction Structure"],"section_title":"Hardware Abstraction Structure","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":79,"source_line_start":79,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Instead, it consumes keypad and LCD interfaces built over GPIO.","text_sha256":"e03ddca63e2ddfedf725ad16a0bc92863f85410dd16e8dc5f435b04a35e3c02b","unit_id":"s009","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-035-s009-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s009","section_path":["Hardware Abstraction Structure"],"section_title":"Hardware Abstraction Structure","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":81,"source_line_start":81,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This is an early layered embedded structure in which application semantics sit above lower-level peripheral handling.","text_sha256":"df8ee8549756c08d7980b4b1e765d081d1a57595fa0be8de4817cd13d418b10f","unit_id":"s009","word_count":16},{"block_id":"repo-035-s013-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s013","section_path":["Engineering Skills Demonstrated","Fixed-Buffer Processing"],"section_title":"Fixed-Buffer Processing","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":101,"source_line_start":101,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Input is captured into a bounded RAM buffer with explicit indices.","text_sha256":"f2bac8c52a5d49e75f7cf8b8cf0725290e7b37774a46da39fb228f786b718319","unit_id":"s013","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-035-s014-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s014","section_path":["Engineering Skills Demonstrated","Numeric Parsing"],"section_title":"Numeric Parsing","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":105,"source_line_start":105,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Decimal integers are reconstructed manually from individual keypad digits.","text_sha256":"9965a08364aa0f9c96884490615e1cc6e1de9ae9689a44f05b5a00ef6a8ab5f7","unit_id":"s014","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-035-s015-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s015","section_path":["Engineering Skills Demonstrated","Control Flow"],"section_title":"Control Flow","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":109,"source_line_start":109,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"A small parser identifies the operator and dispatches arithmetic through a switch.","text_sha256":"154ba5c9099377e872a4b04c4f37af890a0412d00888ce0d317ce37cf07391d4","unit_id":"s015","word_count":12},{"block_id":"repo-035-s016-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s016","section_path":["Engineering Skills Demonstrated","Hardware Abstraction Consumption"],"section_title":"Hardware Abstraction Consumption","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":113,"source_line_start":113,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The application sits above GPIO/keypad/LCD layers instead of putting all register logic in one source file.","text_sha256":"0c9a065f2d5d64f2cb000792648fe561da5283ffa42c6aae231b06671d72afd5","unit_id":"s016","word_count":16},{"block_id":"repo-035-s017-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s017","section_path":["Capability Developed"],"section_title":"Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":119,"source_line_start":119,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Compared with a register-level exercise, the focus moves upward toward input semantics, parsing, application state, presentation, and reuse of device abstractions.","text_sha256":"4de4ba91b01f120c610a7c20c2e9dc58122520b4a364f163d58eb208ca17258b","unit_id":"s017","word_count":21},{"block_id":"repo-035-s018-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s018","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":123,"source_line_start":123,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Simple-Calculator` follows the previous day''s AVR stopwatch.","text_sha256":"ed513340d55cf86c2d4aaa7c1ae06c6984984c65da1bf7919ebf9cd1e0276bf0","unit_id":"s018","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-035-s018-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s018","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":125,"source_line_start":125,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The stopwatch emphasized interrupts and timer hardware.","text_sha256":"89184ab95cab5faae98769c5978528a27db62e63190b8df86ee6d4837e494d8b","unit_id":"s018","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-035-s018-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s018","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution","source_file":"repositories/repo-035-Simple-Calculator/README.md","source_line_end":127,"source_line_start":127,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The calculator emphasizes peripheral abstraction, interactive input, numeric parsing, and LCD presentation.","text_sha256":"f322b2ec4037d82ff909906852f9fef3fcd4ab0d096940f122da3474e159acb8"