urement space.","text_sha256":"33316a20f3f7dc872308e198e44c5262470fdec2efb61895b88897f565ac7d6a","unit_id":"s012","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-038-s012-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s012","section_path":["Unscented Kalman Filter","Radar Measurement Prediction"],"section_title":"Radar Measurement Prediction","source_file":"repositories/repo-038-Kalman-Filters/README.md","source_line_end":118,"source_line_start":118,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The resulting measurement dimensions are range, bearing, and radial velocity.","text_sha256":"621f2cbfbdda9c24cc57de3f2531ee0f2a2d5602d73404315ac6f1f5118473c8","unit_id":"s012","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-038-s012-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s012","section_path":["Unscented Kalman Filter","Radar Measurement Prediction"],"section_title":"Radar Measurement Prediction","source_file":"repositories/repo-038-Kalman-Filters/README.md","source_line_end":120,"source_line_start":120,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The source computes range with Euclidean norm, angle with `atan2`, and projected velocity for range rate.","text_sha256":"977913d2b7b31332117fd5699588a56ff9dd164a70d0a9201c84ded24f532162","unit_id":"s012","word_count":16},{"block_id":"repo-038-s012-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s012","section_path":["Unscented Kalman Filter","Radar Measurement Prediction"],"section_title":"Radar Measurement Prediction","source_file":"repositories/repo-038-Kalman-Filters/README.md","source_line_end":122,"source_line_start":122,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It then calculates measurement mean/covariance and injects explicit radar measurement noise.","text_sha256":"c2de4a0d9bcc158ed3b8c185a20933ef7100399bfe15dd75e9a22e770b92c52d","unit_id":"s012","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-038-s013-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s013","section_path":["Unscented Kalman Filter","State Update"],"section_title":"State Update","source_file":"repositories/repo-038-Kalman-Filters/README.md","source_line_end":126,"source_line_start":126,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The source proceeds to `UpdateState()` after radar-measurement prediction.","text_sha256":"a5ebc078ca6b0858679b4093a3d921e95d21fa68eb95d2c571b705e4a97e9b4e","unit_id":"s013","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-038-s013-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s013","section_path":["Unscented Kalman Filter","State Update"],"section_title":"State Update","source_file":"repositories/repo-038-Kalman-Filters/README.md","source_line_end":128,"source_line_start":128,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This completes the conceptual UKF cycle from uncertain state, through nonlinear propagation, into sensor-space correction.","text_sha256":"e6e671e8efa7beb93d15bafefc57ed4c59c005d6e264dd26b21b086ecbe26e7e","unit_id":"s013","word_count":15}]','{"analysis_source_file":"repositories/repo-038-Kalman-Filters/README.md","document_text_sha256":"57f10e31716cc27ce8550aa934a0124eba8e34517b39d61c432c868bbc4d05ce","earliest_source_line":69,"embedding_text_sha256":"95be9d2ff653bbd0af264a88143dd6546d80fad7ef4804e27bd1b718a1bf59ec","normalized_input":"rag-corpus/repositories.jsonl","repository_raw_sha256":"a3c69af899694f61ec61c7bc3a0cce2f7f14a1db74709976885ad2c4bf7229c4","repository_source_line_end":245,"repository_source_line_start":1}');
