2c59b80403c487b","unit_id":"s025","word_count":22},{"block_id":"repo-038-s025-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s025","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-038-Kalman-Filters/README.md","source_line_end":194,"source_line_start":194,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The student work constructs and augments sigma points, predicts them through nonlinear vehicle motion, reconstructs weighted state/covariance, maps state into radar measurements, and advances into update logic.","text_sha256":"f2cb709175ac82aab3543c02256b22194225f22f8e1654306818fc74a63dd780","unit_id":"s025","word_count":27},{"block_id":"repo-038-s025-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s025","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-038-Kalman-Filters/README.md","source_line_end":196,"source_line_start":196,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Because scaffolding and expected outputs are explicit, the repository provides strong evidence of learned estimation skills without overstating ownership of the instructional framework.","text_sha256":"bca258e712276e86a46d9355efc7d47fa1b5bd640dfff708a576dedd7e07957a","unit_id":"s025","word_count":23},{"block_id":"repo-038-s025-b005","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s025","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-038-Kalman-Filters/README.md","source_line_end":198,"source_line_start":198,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"# Project Tags","text_sha256":"4872ed8c74285759658bef4d247fe867904cfa708f396f2481573ec0658bff34","unit_id":"s025","word_count":3},{"block_