olution","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":253,"source_line_start":253,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Historically, `Turtle-Hunter` follows the broader `ROS` practice repository by two days.","text_sha256":"315806f5bf560208625fcabbd55264a729c96fa88632f7e203a83afbef9b3d78","unit_id":"s021","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-041-s021-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s021","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":255,"source_line_start":255,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It is evidence that the learned ROS 2 primitives were immediately recombined into a task-specific behavior.","text_sha256":"e09195c095dfcfefcaf48ed22092d3e51f788946d8d0cd9ac4975f4a1fcdc635","unit_id":"s021","word_count":16},{"block_id":"repo-041-s021-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s021","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":257,"source_line_start":257,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"That makes it useful as a bridge between middleware syntax and later navigation/simulation repositories.","text_sha256":"d3ac3a27c170b2c93573d796eeecc77503abdabbc881c4f7e26c408c761aa647","unit_id":"s021","word_count":14},{"block_id":"repo-041-s022-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s022","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":261,"source_line_start":261,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Within the processed corpus so far, this is the earliest observed repository centered on programmatic target seeking inside `turtlesim`.","text_sha256":"49ad54b2668d8b843141bea11d24c29960bfb0141309e56fe3dedc8f0cf5923b","unit_id":"s022","word_count":19},{"block_id":"repo-041-s022-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s022","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":263,"source_line_start":263,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It also provides an early compact example of a robot behavior being decomposed into separate navigation and environment-generation nodes.","text_sha256":"29a657f32fcc77f0349beff51678de19faeaa82afa953b55a1ba38988dcd8857","unit_id":"s022","word_count":19},{"block_id":"repo-041-s024-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s024","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":281,"source_line_start":281,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Turtle-Hunter` is a concise ROS 2 behavior exercise that combines services, topic feedback, geometry, and motion commands.","text_sha256":"d160c1c374d09155bb28d24ce1e45fad3fbfc878eed4b9e91dadd84b98a106bd","unit_id":"s024","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-041-s024-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s024","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":285,"source_line_start":285,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its value is the composition step: live robot state is turned into a target heading and distance, commands are emitted, and a second node dynamically changes the simulation environment.","text_sha256":"11f49677d98791f2b1d6ae7486260060630f47fd1d3bbab26924197f42f270c4","unit_id":"s024","word_count":29},{"block_id":"repo-041-s024-b006","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s024","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":291,"source_line_start":291,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `educational-project`","text_sha256":"7dc4bf2281ead406d942e056061b30679185c3693b783a3b3016476080553510","unit_id":"s024","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-041-s024-b007","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s024","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":292,"source_line_start":292,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `individual-project`","text_sha256":"d37d3796856631d165d1ea7b024c43b8797da439be1d8255def21d1ecc31bd07","unit_id":"s024","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-041-s024-b008","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s024","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-041-Turtle-Hunter/README.md","source_line_end":293,"source_line_start":293,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `python`","text_sha256":"39da46b5b2c4c7896ca4e06a7144e3ea8d750d9fe27e71b4a0f68992e75b6db5","unit_id":"s024","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-041-s024-b009","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s024","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative"