INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-041-rd007',41,'Turtle-Hunter',NULL,NULL,'limitation','limitations_risks','negative','repository_limitation',0.4475,2,63,'Section: Limitations

The queue workflow described in the README is not visible in the inspected source files.

Navigation is time-based and open-loop after the initial pose read.

The code blocks inside a service callback during time.sleep and travel loops.

