The repository reliably establishes only:

the repository existed by 2024-10-20;
its intended topic was relational database administration.

The title is not sufficient evidence that any specific database-administration workflow was implemented or completed.

Section: Portfolio Evolution Context

Chronologically, this repository sits between the concrete MySQL transaction work in repository 063 and the Kafka/Airflow ETL coursework in repository 065.

It is retained so the corpus preserves the actual portfolio chronology rather than silently dropping sparse repositories.

Section: Evidence Boundary

The corpus does not infer:

a specific RDBMS;

backup/restore work;

user administration;

indexing;

replication;

transaction implementation;

production database operations.

Those would require repository evidence that is absent here.

Section: Overall Repository Narrative

Relational-Database-Administration is a chronology marker and apparent learning-intent repository.

