The title reliably records an intended learning topic involving:

IBM Cognos Analytics;

Google Looker;

business-intelligence dashboards.

It does not provide evidence that either platform was actually used to build a dashboard in this repository snapshot.

Section: Portfolio Evolution Context

That sequencing suggests a move from warehouse construction toward BI consumption, but the repository contents are too sparse to establish implementation.

The corpus preserves it as a chronology marker without converting the title into unsupported skill claims.

Section: Evidence Boundary

No Cognos/Looker implementation capability is tagged as demonstrated.

The platform names are retained only as topic metadata.

Section: Overall Repository Narrative

BI-Dashboards-with-IBM-Cognos-Analytics-and-Google-Looker is a title-only learning-intent repository.

