INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-070-rd005',70,'Testing-Model-Deployment',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','deployment_operations','positive','repository_specific',0.3842,16,211,'Section: Digit-Recognition Deployment > TensorFlow.js Runtime

The page imports TensorFlow.js and TensorFlow.js visualization support from CDNs.

Section: Digit-Recognition Deployment > Model Loading

The checked-in model is loaded at page startup using:

tf.loadLayersModel(''model.json'')

A visible status area communicates model-loading state.

Section: Digit-Recognition Deployment > Input Modes

Two user input methods are implemented:

upload an existing image;
draw a digit freehand on a canvas.

This makes the deployment test interactive rather than hard-coded to one test image.

Section: Prediction Pipeline

After preprocessing:

The page displays both the predicted class and confidence.

Prediction tensors are disposed after use.

Section: Logistic-Regression Deployment > User Inputs

The form collects:

gender;

marital status;

dependents;

education;

self-employment;

applicant income;

co-applicant income;

loan amount;

loan term;

credit history;

property area.

Section: Logistic-Regression Deployment > Feature Transformation

Categorical values are mapped to numerical encodings.

Numeric inputs are parsed from form values.

Section: Logistic-Regression Deployment > Direct Numerical Inference

An 11-element weight array and scalar bias are stored in JavaScript.

The prediction function computes the weighted sum and applies the logistic sigmoid.

A 0.5 threshold selects the rendered approval label.

This is strong evidence of understanding how a simple trained model can be detached from its training environment and reproduced as deterministic frontend math.

Section: Cloud and Delivery

github-pages

static-site-deployment

