INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-078-rd006',78,'Reinforcement-Learning',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.351,7,286,'Section: Q3 — Physics-Informed Predicted Drop

This combines a learned policy with an engineered physics feature.

Section: Epsilon Decay

Q3 also introduces exploration decay.

Its agent starts with a higher exploration probability and multiplies epsilon by a decay factor after updates.

A minimum epsilon prevents exploration from reaching zero.

This changes the policy from fixed exploration to a gradual exploration/exploitation schedule.

Section: Q4 — Richer Tabular Agent

q4.py is the most developed experiment.

It increases state resolution to 20 bins and adjusts core learning parameters.

It keeps the tabular Q-table but adds several additional mechanisms.

Section: Q4 — Richer Tabular Agent > Informed Initialization

The Q-table is preinitialized with a slight preference for middle-range arc values.

New states can also borrow values from nearby existing states.

This is a heuristic initialization strategy.

It is not function approximation.

Section: Q4 — Richer Tabular Agent > Experience Replay

The agent stores transitions in a replay buffer.

The configured buffer size is:

1000 experiences

The target batch size is:

32

After a direct update, the agent can sample past experiences and replay Q-learning updates.

Experience replay is more commonly associated with deep RL, but here it is applied to a tabular Q-table.

The corpus therefore tags experience replay without implying a DQN.

Section: Q4 — Richer Tabular Agent > Shot History

The final agent records recent:

(action, reward)

pairs per state.

It can use historical average reward to prefer an action that has performed well in that state.

This adds a second evidence source to normal Q-value selection.

Section: Q4 — Richer Tabular Agent > Learned Basket-Position Estimate

The agent maintains an estimated basket x-coordinate.

Successful shots contribute predicted-drop samples.

Recent successful samples are averaged to update the estimate.','["q-learning","physics-informed","predicted","drop","epsilon","decay","richer","tabular","agent","informed","initialization","experience","replay","shot","history","learned","basket-position","estimate"]','["Q3 — Physics-Informed Predicted Drop","Epsilon Decay","Q4 — Richer Tabular Agent"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-078-s016-b007","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s016","section_path":["Q3 — Physics-Informed Predicted Drop"],"section_title":"Q3 — Physics-Informed Predicted Drop","source_file":"repositories/repo-078-Reinforcement-Learning/README.md","source_line_end":263,"source_line_start":263,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This combines a learned policy with an engineered physics feature.","text_sha256":"948b82f8d22d91ab0efa825d012967847ba5fdf06ee371d91b7ecb94f2f3b357","unit_id":"s016","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-078-s017-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s017","section_path":["Epsilon Decay"],"section_title":"Epsilon Decay","source_file":"repositories/repo-078-Reinforcement-Learning/README.md","source_line_end":267,"source_line_start":267,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"Q3 also introduces exploration decay.","text_sha256":"8a8d8f6c6d606199b9de45921ef839eea8ffc07938bf3bd8ccb425d88f98727c","unit_id":"s017","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-078-s017-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s017","section_path":["Epsilon Decay"],"section_title":"Epsilon Decay","source_file":"repositories/repo-078-Reinforcement-Learning/README.md","source_line_end":269,"source_line_start":269,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its agent starts with a higher exploration probability and multiplies epsilon by a decay factor after updates.","text_sh