-Learning/README.md","source_line_end":413,"source_line_start":413,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The agent still stores explicit Q-values keyed by discrete state.","text_sha256":"6737f0a826ca8a32cc517b03831a35cdc8fd6978d20ff3badd05f7b4bc40f57e","unit_id":"s028","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-078-s028-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s028","section_path":["Experience Replay Boundary"],"section_title":"Experience Replay Boundary","source_file":"repositories/repo-078-Reinforcement-Learning/README.md","source_line_end":415,"source_line_start":415,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"The correct description is:","text_sha256":"85d4ac52196cc80ff2262ffab7584f74e024ffaff330c6ce33d57a9913d64e6d","unit_id":"s028","word_count":4}]','{"analysis_source_file":"repositories/repo-078-Reinforcement-Learning/README.md","document_text_sha256":"a65bb783edef407952966b6006b2e4912cd2b9b4ddd3ada74943e829d0c3cb63","earliest_source_line":337,"embedding_text_sha256":"ba7e112ec3fdebf0b6e12b00c25fb16fd2d846c9763c45a042b89af8037d8c59","normalized_input":"rag-corpus/repositories.jsonl","repository_raw_sha256":"166773576240fa017092f7459e3b7146f86700e3754daa511e67a013689021ef","repository_source_line_end":599,"repository_source_line_start":1}');
INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-078-rd008',78,'Reinforcement-Learning',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3303,14,162,'Section: Experience Replay Boundary

tabular Q-learning,
with experience replay.

Section: Engineering Discipline

The repository demonstrates disciplined comparative iteration.

Rather than overwriting one file repeatedly, it preserves:

baseline,

Q1,

Q2,

Q3,

Q4.

That makes design evolution inspectable.

Each version changes a meaningful variable:

state,

prediction,

exploration,

replay,

heuristics.

This is useful engineering provenance.

Section: Skills Demonstrated

Directly supported skills include:

reinforcement learning,

tabular Q-learning,

Q-value updates,

epsilon-greedy exploration,

epsilon decay,

state discretization,

action-space design,

reward shaping,

experience replay,

online learning,

simulation-based learning,

physics-informed features,

projectile-motion modeling,

Python,

Pygame,

event-driven game loops,

object-oriented game structure.

Section: Capability Developed

The repository demonstrates the ability to build an environment and then progressively design an agent around it.

Section: Portfolio Evolution Context

Pygame-style interactive simulation,

and turns them into a reinforcement-learning control task.

Section: Historical Significance

Q-learning,

epsilon-greedy control,

Pygame.

It is also an early example of using physics knowledge to engineer an RL state and heuristic.

Section: Evidence Boundaries

The repository does not implement deep Q-learning.','["reinforcement-learning","q-learning","epsilon-greedy","projectile-motion","pygame","python","experience","replay","boundary","engineering","discipline","skills","demonstrated","capability","developed","portfolio","evolution","context","historical","significance","boundaries"]','["Experience Replay Boundary","Engineering Discipline","Skills Demonstrated","Capability Developed","Portfolio Evolution Context","Historical Significance","Evidence Boundaries"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-078-s028-b005","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s028","section_path":["Experience Replay Boundary"],"section_title":"Experience Replay Boundary","source_file":"repositories/repo-078-Reinforcement-Learning/README.md","source_line_end":418,"source_line_start":417,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"- tabular Q-learning,\n- with experience replay.","text_sha256":"74f034e2034a3c31e83093afa0e98d0269d27cbc803bafabbd8287f1965d9ad4","unit_id":"s028","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-078-s030-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s030","section_path":["Engineering Discipline"],"section_title":"Engineering Discipline","source_file":"repositories/repo-078-Reinforcement-Learning/README.md","source_line_end":440,"source_line_start":440,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"The repository demonstrates disciplined comparative iteration.","text_sha256":"53cef53e67a242ba1547ce893863ea3985f3584f38dd9b693272edb74d8dd603","unit_id":"s030","word_count":6},{"block_id":"repo-078-s030-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s030","section_path":["Engineering Discipline"],"section_title":"Engineering Discipline","source_file":"repositories/repo-078-Reinforcement-Learning/README.md","source_line_end":442,"source_line_start":442,"specifi