INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-079-rd012',79,'SDR',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','product_responsibility','neutral','interpretive',0.34,0,58,'Section: Product Engineering

Although research-oriented, the GUI adds product-like operational features.

A user can:

select network mode,

configure endpoints,

choose thread count,

start and stop listening,

inspect logs,

inspect statistics.

This reduces the need to modify source for each experiment.

