INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-080-rd003',80,'ViT',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.4187,28,194,'Section: What the Project Is

The notebook evaluates several pretrained image-classification architectures on an ImageNet-style validation subset.

The compared model families are:

Vision Transformer,

ResNet-50,

BEiT-V2.

The experiment does not train these networks from scratch.

It loads pretrained models using timm, runs inference, and compares:

Top-1 accuracy,

Top-5 accuracy,

inference time.

This is a model-evaluation exercise.

Section: Dataset Loading

The notebook uses torchvision.datasets.ImageFolder.

The stored execution output reports:

The experiment selects a 10% subset.

A fixed NumPy seed is used before choosing the subset indices.

That improves repeatability of the selected sample set.

Section: Preprocessing

The preprocessing pipeline matches common ImageNet inference preprocessing.

It includes:

resize to 256,

center crop to 224,

tensor conversion,

ImageNet normalization.

The normalization means are:

[0.485, 0.456, 0.406]

and the standard deviations are:

[0.229, 0.224, 0.225]

The subset is loaded through a PyTorch DataLoader.

Section: Hardware Selection

The notebook chooses:

cuda if available else cpu

The stored output reports that CUDA was used for the recorded run.

This is direct evidence of GPU-backed inference in that execution.

Section: Model Loading

The notebook uses timm.create_model(..., pretrained=True).

Visible model constructors include:

vit_base_patch16_224,

resnet50,

beitv2_large_patch16_224.

Each model is:

created with pretrained weights,','["model-evaluation","python","pytorch","torchvision","timm","resnet50","beit-v2","imagenet","image-classification","cuda","dataloader","dataset","loading","preprocessing","hardware","selection","model"]','["What the Project Is","Dataset Loading","Preprocessing","Hardware Selection","Model Loading"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-080-s003-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-080-ViT/README.md","source_line_end":30,"source_line_start":30,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The notebook evaluates several pretrained image-classification architectures on an ImageNet-style validation subset.","text_sha256":"984efdad0767adf0700f39aa4c9ec4ee8a0e3975ac129015f68d52950d7a58ee","unit_id":"s003","word_count":12},{"block_id":"repo-080-s003-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-080-ViT/README.md","source_line_end":32,"source_line_start":32,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"The compared model families are:","text_sha256":"65c4dc88a1ee8702c3c98c046330f12eed58503dbe5cd4a89caf2a991f4aa957","unit_id":"s003","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-080-s003-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-080-ViT/README.md","source_line_end":34,"source_line_start":34,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- Vision Transformer,","text_sha256":"5e75aae6def782c323da413e4a349b74bd0a0f83b1c0293d6f5f25282e7f7d5f","unit_id":"s003","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-080-s00