INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-081-rd003',81,'Milestone',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.396,10,160,'Section: What the Project Is

Milestone is a browser-based progress tracker built around tracks and milestones.

Its final checked-in application includes:

user registration,

user login,

hashed-password storage,

an authority field,

authority-based routing,

track creation and management,

milestone creation and management,

milestone timelines,

reports,

notifications,

bottleneck checks,

Firebase persistence.

The product is implemented as large static HTML documents with embedded CSS and JavaScript.

There is no separate frontend framework in the current snapshot.

Section: Application Split

The application is split into two major pages.

Section: Application Split > index.html

Responsible for:

registration,

login,

basic user validation,

password hashing,

storing user records,

authority assignment,

authority-based navigation.

Section: Application Split > kilostone.html

Responsible for:

track management,

milestone management,

timeline interaction,

reporting,

notifications,

bottleneck detection,

Firebase CRUD operations.

This is a page-level separation rather than a componentized application architecture.

Section: Registration Workflow

The registration page collects:

username,

email,

birth date,

password,

password confirmation.

Client-side validation checks include:

all required fields present,

username character restrictions,','["html","javascript","firebase","application","split","index.html","kilostone.html","registration","workflow"]','["What the Project Is","Application Split","Registration Workflow"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-081-s003-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-081-Milestone/README.md","source_line_end":45,"source_line_start":45,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Milestone` is a browser-based progress tracker built around tracks and milestones.","text_sha256":"848b0969f9499004ecbfbd775922114b7c98fb4eb51a2049f232b9d8095d0405","unit_id":"s003","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-081-s003-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-081-Milestone/README.md","source_line_end":47,"source_line_start":47,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"Its final checked-in application includes:","text_sha256":"5740a9fc43e085615e7ead8c30d779b75c81bf59e597a09f42ed71f2c1219883","unit_id":"s003","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-081-s003-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-081-Milestone/README.md","source_line_end":49,"source_line_start":49,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- user registration,","text_sha256":"72663262c0f1cfb0a55c42566b142da081a016ee6f2cbaef9eca5d5d1b5225c5","unit_id":"s003","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-081-s003-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What