INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-083-rd003',83,'LanguageStudy',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.4134,10,222,'Section: What the Project Is

LanguageStudy is a small bilingual vocabulary-capture and study-support application.

Its core workflow is not simply a static dictionary page.

A user chooses between English and French, enters a word or expression, categorizes it, and stores it in Firebase Realtime Database.

The same application can later retrieve saved entries and turn selected vocabulary into a downloadable PDF.

This makes the project a compact combination of:

language-learning utility;

structured vocabulary capture;

lightweight persistence;

bilingual UI localization;

duplicate prevention;

filtering and sorting;

client-side document generation.

The application is oriented around building a personal language corpus over time.

The repository name is generic, but the implementation is specifically about vocabulary acquisition and export.

Section: Project Scope

The implemented scope is deliberately narrow: vocabulary capture, language/category organization, Firebase persistence, duplicate rejection, retrieval, sorting, and PDF export.

The repository does not implement a general language-learning platform, spaced-repetition engine, account system, or NLP service.

Its scope is best described as a personal bilingual vocabulary-management utility with export capability.

Section: User-Facing Workflow > Vocabulary Capture

The user enters a word or expression.

The user selects a category.

Observed categories include:

Synonym

Phrasal

Idiom

Compound

Pronunciation

Conjunction

Collocations

Grammar

The selected interface language determines which logical language branch receives the new entry.

The application writes each accepted entry with:

the text of the word;

its category;','["firebase","language-learning","localization","english","french","scope","user-facing","workflow","vocabulary","capture"]','["What the Project Is","Project Scope","User-Facing Workflow"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-083-s003-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-083-LanguageStudy/README.md","source_line_end":37,"source_line_start":37,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"LanguageStudy is a small bilingual vocabulary-capture and study-support application.","text_sha256":"c5b8d37fc978e660a491be718d8f824f85d50b60177f9fad4447d2c433f2eb84","unit_id":"s003","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-083-s003-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-083-LanguageStudy/README.md","source_line_end":39,"source_line_start":39,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its core workflow is not simply a static dictionary page.","text_sha256":"cabb878a61cce25a3f44243f8b2cb16bfc8731f8d54a4d297e55e84563f2ff57","unit_id":"s003","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-083-s003-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-083-LanguageStudy/README.md","source_line_end":41,"source_line_start":41,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"A user chooses between English and French, enters a word or expression, categorizes it, and stores it in Firebase Realtime Database.","text_sha256":"eac289bb6e218b85de3abaae36c69930e679699d872a8091ef56e133b980f21d","unit_id":"s003","word_count":21},{"block_id":"repo-083