INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-083-rd005',83,'LanguageStudy',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.377,14,269,'Section: User-Facing Workflow > PDF Export

jsPDF AutoTable renders the tabular body.

The generated file is downloaded directly from the browser.

No backend document-generation service is involved.

Section: Data Model

The observable logical structure is language-partitioned.

A conceptual representation is:

The generated child key comes from Firebase push.

The data model is intentionally lightweight.

Language is encoded structurally in the database path.

Category is encoded as an attribute.

Timestamp supports chronological presentation.

There is no visible user/account namespace.

There is no visible ownership field.

There is no visible per-user isolation in the application model.

Section: Technical Stack > Persistence

Firebase
Firebase Realtime Database

Section: Technical Stack > Document Generation

jsPDF
jsPDF AutoTable

Section: Technical Stack > External Delivery Model

browser-loaded CDN dependencies

browser-side Firebase SDK

client-side PDF generation

Section: Major Engineering Work > 1. Bilingual State-Driven UI

The application models English/French text in translation objects.

UI controls are refreshed from those objects.

Category options are reconstructed based on the active language.

Current selection state is intentionally preserved when possible.

This demonstrates a small localization state model rather than only static translated copy.

Section: Major Engineering Work > 2. Duplicate Detection

The code implements a read-before-write workflow.

It performs case-insensitive comparison of vocabulary text.

It combines word identity with category identity.

This prevents accidental repeated entries within a category.

The check is implemented in application code.

It is therefore subject to the usual race limitations of client-side read-then-write logic.

Section: Major Engineering Work > 3. Firebase Persistence

The project establishes direct browser persistence.

Entries are stored as structured objects rather than concatenated strings.

A timestamp is added at insertion time.','["firebase","localization","english","french","jspdf","user-facing","workflow","export","data","model","technical","stack","persistence","document","generation","external","delivery","major","engineering","work","bilingual","state-driven","duplicate","detection"]','["User-Facing Workflow","Data Model","Technical Stack","Major Engineering Work"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-083-s009-b011","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s009","section_path":["User-Facing Workflow","PDF Export"],"section_title":"PDF Export","source_file":"repositories/repo-083-LanguageStudy/README.md","source_line_end":155,"source_line_start":155,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"jsPDF AutoTable renders the tabular body.","text_sha256":"cf161cbd5ca3d25b7568333229d12207982ee41222b17a795dc3ebbb37ab643f","unit_id":"s009","word_count":6},{"block_id":"repo-083-s009-b012","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s009","section_path":["User-Facing Workflow","PDF Export"],"section_title":"PDF Export","source_file":"repositories/repo-083-LanguageStudy/README.md","source_line_end":157,"source_line_start":157,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The generated file is downloaded directly from the browser.","text_sha256":"d74a6660d97c73205c7a08c9d51d281fe748edb16c35d837c3183e860408e9dc","unit_id":"s009","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-083-s009-b013","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s009","section_path":["User-Facing Workflow","PDF Export"],"section_title":"PDF Export","source_file":"repositories/repo-083-LanguageStudy/README.md","source_line_end":159,"source_line_start":159,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"No backend document-generation service is involved.","text_sha256":"bf1a16e6e85993f503c86765f2f61b2a55ffdadc7d6c9