INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-083-rd006',83,'LanguageStudy',NULL,NULL,'direct_evidence','architecture_system_design','positive','repository_specific',0.3878,2,74,'Section: Architecture / System Shape

The system is a client-heavy browser application.

A simplified architecture is:

There is no repository evidence of a custom backend.

There is no checked-in server-side API.

There is no application server responsible for validation.

There is no server-side PDF process.

Data access happens directly from browser code to Firebase Realtime Database.

