INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-083-rd012',83,'LanguageStudy',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','product_responsibility','neutral','interpretive',0.3323,1,93,'Section: Product Engineering

The repository solves a recognizable recurring user need.

The application is more product-shaped than a pure frontend exercise because it combines:

persistent personal data;

data-quality checks;

language switching;

multiple data categories;

structured retrieval;

export.

The PDF export is particularly meaningful from a product perspective.

It lets the user transform a living database into a printable or portable study artifact.

The project does not provide evidence of:

multiple accounts;

shared vocabularies;

review scheduling;

spaced repetition;

quiz generation;

progress analytics;

authentication;

authorization.

Those features should not be inferred from the language-learning domain.','["language-learning","product","engineering"]','["Product Engineering"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-083-s026-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Product Engineering"],"section_title":"Product Engineering","source_file":"repositories/repo-083-LanguageStudy/README.md","source_line_end":387,"source_line_start":387,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository solves a recognizable recurring user need.","text_sha256":"fb6796525cd8584c345e59e30dc5ff04b42ac9431c21739c8aa35a6565fabbfa","unit_id":"s026","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-083-s026-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Product Engineering"],"section_title":"Product Engineering","source_file":"repositories/repo-083-LanguageStudy/README.md","source_line_end":389,"source_line_start":389,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The application is more product-shaped than a pure frontend exercise because it combines:","text_sha256":"39803fadd49955c85f3a6b54e7d0e71ec973ec0690d7de9fdbb73535de8e603d","unit_id":"s026","word_count":13},{"block_id":"repo-083-s026-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Product Engineering"],"section_title":"Product Engineering","source_file":"repositories/repo-083-LanguageStudy/README.md","source_line_end":391,"source_line_start":391,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- persistent personal data;","text_sha256":"51f1380f518c8969c4c67700b8ba62c4b922612902505793154a9ec6a10a94d9","unit_id":"s026","word_count":4},{"block_id":"repo-083-s026-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Product Engineering"],"section_tit