INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-089-rd003',89,'Robotics-Project',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3789,15,222,'Section: What the Project Is

Robotics-Project is a compact mobile-manipulator/unicycle navigation controller experiment.

It initializes a simulation with:

initial robot pose;

pickup location;

drop-off location;

multiple obstacle coordinates.

The active controller drives the mobile base toward the pickup location.

It computes position and heading error.

It converts those errors into:

linear velocity v;
angular velocity omega.

It clips both controls to configured limits.

The loop stops when the robot is sufficiently close to the goal or after a timeout.

Section: Project Scope

The implemented scope is a small goal-reaching control loop for a unicycle-style mobile base inside an external simulator.

It does not include the simulator implementation, formal CLF optimization, obstacle avoidance, manipulation logic, path planning, or physical-robot control.

Section: Simulation Setup

MobileManipulatorUnicycleSim is instantiated with:

robot_id;

no backend server IP;

robot pose;

pickup location;

drop-off location;

obstacle locations.

The script reads robot state through get_poses.

It commands the base through set_mobile_base_speed_and_gripper_power.

Gripper power remains zero during the visible controller.

The script is therefore focused on base motion rather than manipulation.

Section: Goal Selection

The target pose is set from robot.pickup_location.

The controller extracts:

x_goal;

y_goal;

theta_goal.

In the visible loop, theta_goal is not directly used as the final orientation target.

Instead, heading target is recalculated toward the current goal position.

This means the controller''s effective objective is reaching the pickup position.','["robotics","mobile-manipulator","goal-reaching","scope","simulation","setup","goal","selection"]','["What the Project Is","Project Scope","Simulation Setup","Goal Selection"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-089-s003-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-089-Robotics-Project/README.md","source_line_end":41,"source_line_start":41,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Robotics-Project is a compact mobile-manipulator/unicycle navigation controller experiment.","text_sha256":"52cbc244d8cb4a631ce3a48aa8395a1c30ad02aa0c8917eb52c8bdb387e2a194","unit_id":"s003","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-089-s003-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-089-Robotics-Project/README.md","source_line_end":43,"source_line_start":43,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"It initializes a simulation with:","text_sha256":"71c4c5238745650fe5814eabe611b8db8355dc405f36dd4302e34d1dd8a32cd0","unit_id":"s003","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-089-s003-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-089-Robotics-Project/README.md","source_line_end":45,"source_line_start":45,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- initial robot pose;","text_sha256":"1146da0326d17441113be655c357a28a4240844bdd5e45619e047f360d4a2aab","unit_id":"s003","word_count":4},{"block_id":"repo-089-s003-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence