INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-090-rd003',90,'NLP_ENDPOINT',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','neutral','repository_specific',0.3521,7,227,'Section: What the Project Is

NLP_ENDPOINT is an applied generative-NLP prototype that moves beyond a training recipe into an executed model experiment and a user-facing generation interface.

The project has two connected concerns.

The first is fine-tuning GPT-2 on short-form story data.

The second is exposing story generation through a browser workflow.

The notebook handles model/data experimentation.

The HTML page handles product presentation, prompt entry, examples, request state, and result display.

Together they form a small end-to-end model-application experiment.

Section: Project Scope

The retained scope includes:

loading TinyStories from Hugging Face;

selecting a bounded training subset;

preparing a GPT-2 tokenizer;

adapting padding behavior for causal language modeling;

tokenizing story text;

preparing training and validation data;

configuring model training;

generating text from prompts;

evaluating the trained model with validation-oriented metrics;

presenting a polished web prompt interface;

sending prompts to a generation endpoint;

rendering returned stories in the client.

The repository is not simply a static UI mockup.

The notebook gives executable ML evidence and the client contains concrete remote-request integration.

At the same time, the repository does not establish durable production hosting, production traffic, or a persistent model-serving platform.

Section: Technical Stack > Browser Layer

HTML

CSS

JavaScript

Tailwind CSS via CDN

Google Fonts

Fetch API

JSON request/response handling

Section: Technical Stack > Experimental Serving Boundary

The browser sends a POST request containing JSON with a prompt field.','["generative-nlp","tinystories","html","javascript","scope","technical","stack","browser","layer","experimental","serving","boundary"]','["What the Project Is","Project Scope","Technical Stack"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-090-s003-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-090-NLP_ENDPOINT/README.md","source_line_end":45,"source_line_start":45,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"NLP_ENDPOINT is an applied generative-NLP prototype that moves beyond a training recipe into an executed model experiment and a user-facing generation interface.","text_sha256":"cfc5f13b73ce8992201d57f1c4e09e022c7a81d9379e8bbb588eea670b47baa2","unit_id":"s003","word_count":22},{"block_id":"repo-090-s003-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-090-NLP_ENDPOINT/README.md","source_line_end":47,"source_line_start":47,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"The project has two connected concerns.","text_sha256":"eba24d0895b68be8845d00ee2535ba8e68e437cf7ad073d57583025e01bb903e","unit_id":"s003","word_count":6},{"block_id":"repo-090-s003-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What the Project Is"],"section_title":"What the Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-090-NLP_ENDPOINT/README.md","source_line_end":49,"source_line_start":49,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The first is fine-tuning GPT-2 on short-form story data.","text_sha256":"89c49ee73afc9da33565dcb20c9e0e346ab481cac6a24f998e684693bd856ae8","unit_id":"s003","w