Complexity comes from crossing multiple engineering domains:

dataset management;

NLP preprocessing;

transformer fine-tuning;

GPU notebook execution;

generation decoding;

model evaluation;

HTTP integration;

frontend interaction design.

The repository remains a prototype-scale system.

