INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-091-rd009',91,'RogersExperiment',NULL,NULL,'direct_evidence','testing_quality','positive','repository_specific',0.3794,1,74,'Section: Testing & Verification

The primary verification mechanism is simulation execution and FlowMonitor output.

The source prints or records the measured result for each configured distance.

The generated CSV provides a persistent experiment product.

There is no evidence of a separate automated regression suite around the simulation model.

More importantly, there is no repository evidence that the simulated curve was validated against physical Rogers-network measurements.

