iment/README.md","source_line_end":319,"source_line_start":319,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Instead of treating “distance affects throughput” as a qualitative statement, the code turns distance into a sweep and produces measured simulated outputs.","text_sha256":"656380d3c730a71a7d596861fc3aaedc9e7464a66baa7938f7276b368b7f2d93","unit_id":"s024","word_count":22},{"block_id":"repo-091-s024-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s024","section_path":["What Was Learned / Capability Developed"],"section_title":"What Was Learned / Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-091-RogersExperiment/README.md","source_line_end":321,"source_line_start":321,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It also reinforces that network-performance experiments depend strongly on assumptions such as MCS, offered load, channel width, and mobility.","text_sha256":"073c3e7d70f1149dddbb82281bb972ff0f2956669222a8365c857f106c8a9a77","unit_id":"s024","word_count":19},{"block_id":"repo-091-s024-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s024","section_path":["What Was Learned / Capability Developed"],"section_title":"What Was Learned / Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-091-RogersExperiment/README.md","source_line_end":323,"source_line_start":323,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"That is useful preparation for later physical wireless experiments in the portfolio.","text_sha256":"b4c25296f19155edcd0c44574780e7b545b7c3411896ceb0f3d5afd6150ccc6d","unit_id":"s024","word_count":12},{"block_id":"repo-091-s025-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s025","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-091-RogersExperiment