INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-091-rd012',91,'RogersExperiment',NULL,NULL,'limitation','limitations_risks','negative','repository_limitation',0.42,0,67,'Section: Limitations & Missing Evidence

The source supports a simulated Wi-Fi result only.

It does not establish a Rogers network test, cellular radio model, or physical device measurement.

The fixed rate/MCS configuration limits how broadly the distance curve can be generalized.

The retained experiment does not establish repeated random seeds or uncertainty statistics for each point.

