INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-092-rd008',92,'Coptic',NULL,NULL,'direct_evidence','testing_quality','positive','implemented_or_concrete',0.5095,5,65,'Section: Testing & Verification

Verification is primarily manual/data-oriented.

The browser provides direct lookup feedback for dictionary entries.

Python''s import/runtime semantics validate that mapping files are syntactically valid.

The repository does not contain a linguistic gold-standard comparison or automated duplicate-key audit.

