INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-094-rd010',94,'Fast-FTP',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','product_responsibility','positive','interpretive',0.34,0,57,'Section: Product Engineering

Fast-FTP is closer to a networking component/prototype than a finished product.

The retained controller could sit behind an application UI, but the repository primarily demonstrates transport behavior.

Its user value would be fast file upload to a known FTP endpoint.

