INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-096-rd008',96,'SocketLib',NULL,NULL,'limitation','limitations_risks','negative','repository_limitation',0.4515,2,76,'Section: Major Engineering Work > Positive and Negative Allocation Paths

REQUEST handling can result in ACK or NAK rather than assuming every request succeeds.

Section: Limitations & Missing Evidence

The retained server implements a useful core subset, not every DHCP state/message.

Lease state is in memory and resets when the process exits.

The repository does not establish formal RFC conformance or production-LAN deployment.

