te even when they are implemented in one small process.","text_sha256":"0dd34f9b53a63866e549de188276a724cafa8fd5ab470bd0f7bad4d6a99cf253","unit_id":"s029","word_count":19},{"block_id":"repo-096-s029-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s029","section_path":["What Was Learned / Capability Developed"],"section_title":"What Was Learned / Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-096-SocketLib/README.md","source_line_end":367,"source_line_start":367,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"That is useful preparation for systems/network engineering beyond framework-based application development.","text_sha256":"77c887c7944f92e1fa176a0527dfb8895c26b24a4e2ece433a625133972ce90a","unit_id":"s029","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-096-s030-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s030","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-096-SocketLib/README.md","source_line_end":375,"source_line_start":375,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Instead of implementing a file-transfer conversation on top of a configured IP network, this project implements part of the mechanism that gives hosts their IP configuration in the first place.","text_sha256":"4fc0165f7a9165f1d30fb1564010b9be86dca77f69419212afc9e2006e23ab03","unit_id":"s030","word_count":30},{"block_id":"repo-096-s031-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s031","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-096-SocketLib/README.md","source_line_end":381,"source_line_start":381,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Within the processed corpus, this is the earliest observed hand-built DHCP server with manual BOOTP/DHCP binary packing, lease-pool logic, and OFFER/ACK/NAK response construction.","text_sha256":"f2e843fb7e119ea161c92abbdd8bf15adafc269ff8b335625ec95ff5b8de5017","unit_id":"s031","word_count":23},{"block_id":"repo-096-s031-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s031","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-096-SocketLib/README.md","source_line_end":383,"source_line_start":383,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It demonstrates a transition from using sockets for application data to implementing a standardized network configuration protocol directly.","text_sha256":"aa1b6fc61100d093c51bb844315572727acea11861739bc45969cc83a8eb34a8","unit_id":"s031","word_count":18},{"block_id":"repo-096-s033-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s033","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-096-SocketLib/README.md","source_line_end":397,"source_line_start":397,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"SocketLib is a compact but technically dense Python DHCP server experiment.","text_sha256":"6b8182ce57a48c50e20bbb2f7a8757f3b1a8160985aea6d71c59fa3a2e76cbc7","unit_id":"s033","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-096-s033-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s033","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-096-SocketLib/README.md","source_line_end":399,"source_line_start":399,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It binds to the standard server port, parses raw BOOTP/DHCP packets, handles DHCP options, tracks an address pool and expiring leases, and manually constructs broadcast OFFER, ACK, and NAK responses using binary packing.","text_sha256":"49e4d8bfcf848c1075c898c5ef07b96c899fe7c7c89529b6167b516d5eceb891","unit_id":"s033","word_count":33},{"block_id":"repo-096-s033-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s033","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-096-SocketLib/README.md","source_line_end":401,"source_line_start":401,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its value is direct protocol understanding: the code works at the byte and network-state level rather than hiding DHCP behind a high-level library.","text_sha256":"6485dad016b4f3c892461a3c3d064caa07972516266ea4900a1ef37bd1b4fc5c","unit_id":"s033","word_count":23},{"block_id":"repo-096-s033-b005","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":4,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s033","section_path":["Overall Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-096-SocketLib/README.md","source_line_end":405,"source_line_start":405,"specificity_score":0.72,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`individual-project`, `python`, `socket-programming`, `udp`, `udp-server`, `broadcast`, `dhcp`, `bootp`, `dhcp-server`, `binary-protocol`, `binary-packet-parsing`, `struct-pack`, `struct-unpack`, `tlv-options`, `dhcp-options`, `dhcp-magic-cookie`, `discover-offer`, `request-ack`, `dhcp-nak`, `dora`, `ipv4`, `mac-address`, `address-pool`, `lease-management`, `lease-expiration`, `in-memory-state`, `subnet-mask-option`, `router-option`, `dns-option`, `server-identifier`, `network-infrastructure`, `privileged-port`, `protocol-implementation`, `earliest-observed-manual-dhcp-server`, `earliest-observed-bootp-dhcp-binary-packet-construction`","text_sha256":"f53b32d783bcce42927afb27148667eb5323648a0b12f937317e07ea7bfd0d42","unit_id":"s033","word_count":35}]','{"analysis_source_file":"repositories/repo