rotocol Engineering","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":622,"source_line_start":622,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- DHCP RELEASE handling","text_sha256":"79ae7005241e556d0adef33ff22d766d68a57efa5f89d50e48a51765eeb65753","unit_id":"s049","word_count":4},{"block_id":"repo-097-s050-b009","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s050","section_path":["Capability Developed"],"section_title":"Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":638,"source_line_start":638,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository also deepens the immediately preceding DHCP work with explicit reservations and RELEASE processing.","text_sha256":"4eed62a6b1ccfaf06733f317f09fcbf4ed7d5d47d6b74ffcf629c1e96eabe98b","unit_id":"s050","word_count":15},{"block_id":"repo-097-s051-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s051","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":642,"source_line_start":642,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Repository 096 established the processed corpus''s earliest manually implemented DHCP/BOOTP server.","text_sha256":"2f545831e41a8b8a321074aed1cc80fc6792d6527d067d74f6451d2c524e0b12","unit_id":"s051","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-097-s051-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s051","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":644,"source_line_start":644,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Repository 097 continues that low-level protocol work while adding a distinct research-tooling layer for Aruba Wi-Fi telemetry and repeatable ping/iperf3 capture.","text_sha256":"d996499212513809e3f36fd297ed1db65b9c8507b2ffa3928a8225aab851471e","unit_id":"s051","word_count":21},{"block_id":"repo-097-s051-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s051","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":646,"source_line_start":646,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The strongest evolution is the integration of protocol-level networking with wireless measurement support, building on the DHCP capability already established in repository 096.","text_sha256":"a6ea1ae7d8fc333cf93717556822f20ac204ec76035103abea0f56a2892ce625","unit_id":"s051","word_count":23},{"block_id":"repo-097-s051-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s051","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":648,"source_line_start":648,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It also provides the first processed-repository evidence in this immediate sequence of dedicated BSSID-transition and channel-transition analysis sourced from Aruba station logs.","text_sha256":"b2916ff8595300c1d06434d6a2f0371d12168f5c0f18be6d1ae9c2f8234a3a4e","unit_id":"s051","word_count":22},{"block_id":"repo-097-s052-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s052","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":652,"source_line_start":652,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Within the processed corpus so far, this repository is the earliest observed dedicated Aruba station-log analysis toolkit centered on:","text_sha256":"b0fcf014b5e070a3eadf2d65948ae9ff9b84871ea5e369922027800d44febc05","unit_id":"s052","word_count":19},{"block_id":"repo-097-s052-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s052","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":654,"source_line_start":654,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- BSSID transition history;","text_sha256":"9290e59248821dfb3557cad13de87a4f4c07455ef91da1d69329825873316f8e","unit_id":"s052","word_count":4},{"block_id":"repo-097-s052-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s052","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":656,"source_line_start":656,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- target-station RSSI/SNR;","text_sha256":"4e782bea71eb4266111e80a95f699487d7ced71551e4fdf5eb9c0e7a4eec4f15","unit_id":"s052","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-097-s052-b006","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s052","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":659,"source_line_start":659,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It is also the first processed repository after the initial DHCP server to extend that implementation pattern with explicit static reservations and DHCP RELEASE handling.","text_sha256":"cb8cd5065943dfc07c859e5d2963f940218cf0102466a6461d75637918961e90","unit_id":"s052","word_count":25},{"block_id":"repo-097-s053-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s053","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":663,"source_line_start":663,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Thesis-Scripts` is a compact but broad networking-research support repository.","text_sha256":"f512183ff2a8a6e776d30166b5a0cb05f30caeeeb6fcaec4becc605018f0c632","unit_id":"s053","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-097-s053-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s053","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":665,"source_line_start":665,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its Aruba tools parse semi-structured wireless infrastructure logs into per-client BSSID, channel, RSSI, SNR, and transition views.","text_sha256":"cb3971728fbbdf4888b3a15bc3cb25239ad9aff79cca33952dd1e7f689b118cf","unit_id":"s053","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-097-s053-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s053","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":667,"source_line_start":667,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its endpoint scripts automate timestamped ping and iperf3 acquisition.","text_sha256":"1deadb660cbd8b64c35e150932526a9c8507b386a5352111976a73fceadde2bc","unit_id":"s053","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-097-s053-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s053","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":669,"source_line_start":669,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its socket code manually implements core DHCP/BOOTP behavior with binary packet construction, address pools, static reservations, expiring leases, and RELEASE processing.","text_sha256":"3ead30e8e9b45f25be4187d24f3673c37e64451456f3c090e19c611ec3e86bc1","unit_id":"s053","word_count":21},{"block_id":"repo-097-s053-b005","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s053","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","source_line_end":671,"source_line_start":671,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Together these utilities show practical movement from individual network-programming exercises toward the support machinery required to run, inspect, and organize wireless experiments.","text_sha256":"d6226b5355c44da5d5844b5d2d7168b858b17ed08c1ab999ecf3d50037e0eda3","unit_id":"s053","word_count":22}]','{"analysis_source_file":"repositories/repo-097-Thesis-Scripts/README.md","document_text_sha256":"7fa220c2f0eb3bdf5c2060e743cf93ad4cbd3f313bbe0ffaeb2d815ca4bd94eb","earliest_source_line":606,"embedding_text_sha256":"adb0044619b87ed58bb780212ed9d963c6a2f95f7f41de38f59f30a02b7b348d","normalized_input":"rag-corpus/repositories.jsonl","repository_raw_sha256":"3e762e77c036bc8fd2253d98e9d8998129f2637354b313f80f52f2d5392fd924","repository_source_line_end":675,"repository_source_line_start":1}');
