INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-101-rd003',101,'Service-Tools',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3683,18,212,'Section: What This Project Is

Service-Tools automates a practical content-production workflow.

The program finds the corresponding result through Genius, retrieves the lyrics page, extracts structured lyric content, separates bracketed sections, and generates a PowerPoint presentation.

The final version wraps that pipeline in a Tkinter desktop interface capable of processing multiple songs in one run.

Section: Technical Stack > Python

Python is the implementation language for all three source files.

It coordinates:

HTTP requests;

HTML parsing;

regular expressions;

presentation generation;

filesystem output;

desktop GUI state;

background threading.

Section: Technical Stack > Requests

The program uses requests to retrieve:

Genius search results;
song lyric pages.

HTTP errors are caught through requests.RequestException.

Section: Technical Stack > Beautiful Soup

BeautifulSoup parses HTML and locates lyric containers.

The code supports:

the data-lyrics-container="true" attribute;
a fallback class pattern matching Lyrics__Container.

Section: Technical Stack > Regular Expressions

Regular expressions are used for:

fallback lyric-container class matching;
splitting lyrics by bracketed section labels.

Section: Technical Stack > python-pptx

The presentation generator uses:

Presentation;

Inches;

Pt;

paragraph alignment;

RGB colors.

This is true programmatic PowerPoint construction rather than static template copying.

Section: Technical Stack > Tkinter

The final interface is implemented with Tkinter.

It includes:

multi-line song input;

output-folder configuration;

generate button;

scrollable progress log;

warning dialog;

completion dialog;

error dialog.','["python","requests","beautifulsoup","python-pptx","tkinter","threading","technical","stack","beautiful","soup","regular","expressions"]','["What This Project Is","Technical Stack"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-101-s003-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-101-Service-Tools/README.md","source_line_end":52,"source_line_start":52,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"`Service-Tools` automates a practical content-production workflow.","text_sha256":"45e28a6d04938fb0117d0dff8f9ed670165c8765af8f3640601c793dd18dc5aa","unit_id":"s003","word_count":6},{"block_id":"repo-101-s003-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-101-Service-Tools/README.md","source_line_end":56,"source_line_start":56,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The program finds the corresponding result through Genius, retrieves the lyrics page, extracts structured lyric content, separates bracketed sections, and generates a PowerPoint presentation.","text_sha256":"e8d3f3b90ba37003f8d6fbf0c79f79be12bbebeb7cb1ae933e1ec1501757a3c0","unit_id":"s003","word_count":24},{"block_id":"repo-101-s003-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s003","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-101-Service-Tools/README.md","source_line_end":58,"source_line_start":58,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The final version wraps that pipeline in a Tkinter desktop interface capable of processing multiple songs in one run