INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-102-rd009',102,'George-Sedra-Website',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.4023,17,321,'Section: Major Engineering Work > Bearer-Protected Administration

This provides a clear trust boundary between public endpoints and internal business operations.

Section: Major Engineering Work > Shared Request Validation

The backend contains dedicated validation modules for:

common values and pagination;

jobs;

applications;

contact requests;

project inquiries.

The latest commit series specifically adds and expands shared payload validation before database operations.

Section: Major Engineering Work > Request Tracing and Error Envelopes

The Hono entrypoint adds request-ID middleware and includes the request ID in successful/error response handling.

Structured ApiError handling maps domain failures into HTTP status/code/message responses.

Section: Major Engineering Work > D1 Health Check

The health route performs SELECT 1 AS ok through D1, which checks the API/database path rather than returning an unconditional static health string.

Section: Major Engineering Work > Prototype Seed Separation

Prototype job seed data is kept under api/seed/ separately from the migration schema, making schema creation independent from sample business records.

Section: Engineering Practices > Human-Review Workflow Modeling

Applications expose explicit human-review states and status history.

Section: Engineering Practices > Minimal-Payload Listing

Resume binary/Base64 data is separated from ordinary application listing/detail metadata, reducing the amount of large file content moved through routine queries.

Section: Engineering Practices > Input Validation Before Persistence

Public and admin payloads pass dedicated parsers before reaching database repositories.

Section: Engineering Practices > Explicit Error Taxonomy

Domain failures use stable codes such as job/application/resume not found and empty update conditions.

Section: Engineering Practices > Environment-Based Secrets

The admin token is read from environment bindings rather than embedded in source.

Section: Engineering Practices > Incremental Architectural Evolution

Commit history shows a clear sequence:

React consulting frontend rebuild;

Hono backend foundation;

Worker/API entrypoint;

authentication and CORS;

database repositories;

admin/public routes;

shared validation;

D1-only Base64 resume correction.

That history provides evidence of architecture being built in layers rather than appearing as one undifferentiated source dump.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Data

Cloudflare D1 / relational SQL — strong evidence.','["react","hono","middleware","request-id","cors","pagination","major","engineering","work","bearer-protected","administration","shared","request","validation","tracing","error","envelopes","health","check","prototype","seed","separation","practices","human-review"]','["Major Engineering Work","Engineering Practices","Skills Demonstrated"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-102-s026-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Bearer-Protected Administration"],"section_title":"Bearer-Protected Administration","source_file":"repositories/repo-102-George-Sedra-Website/README.md","source_line_end":298,"source_line_start":298,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This provides a clear trust boundary between public endpoints and internal business operations.","text_sha256":"d95d1edffe0abbf641f77a7857c747d41ef855ca6d2235e889897b3a4c2c6e5c","unit_id":"s026","word_count":13},{"block_id":"repo-102-s027-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s027","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Shared Request Validation"],"section_title":"Shared Request Validation","source_file":"repositories/repo-102-George-Sedra-Website/README.md","source_line_end":302,"source_line_start":302,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The backend contains dedicated validation modules for:","text_sha256":"eb15ea0d8281d2cdf35dae144b13ffde21e9bd1f14f0c937a96b9d1e60c1a12b","unit_id":"s027","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-102-s027-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s027","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Shared Request Validation"],"section_title":"Shared Request Validation","source_file":"repositories/repo-102-George-Sedra-Website/README.md","source_line_end":304,"source_line_start":3