INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-105-rd007',105,'RF-Power-Logging',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','neutral','repository_specific',0.3376,9,285,'Section: Engineering Practices > Deterministic Output Organization

Timestamped run directories and numbered sweep filenames make batches traceable.

Section: Engineering Practices > Headless Plotting

The acquisition tool selects the non-interactive Matplotlib Agg backend for automation-friendly output.

Section: Engineering Practices > Graceful Stop Behavior

Signals feed a shared event rather than abruptly terminating arbitrary sections of the workflow.

Section: Engineering Practices > Reusable Command-Line Configuration

Frequency range, points, RBW, mode, sweep count, period, port, and output directory are exposed as CLI arguments.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > RF / Instrumentation

Spectrum-analyzer automation — strong evidence.

tinySA control — strong evidence.

Resolution-bandwidth configuration — strong evidence.

RF power measurement — strong evidence.

Repeated spectrum sweeping — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Systems / I/O

Serial communication — strong evidence.

USB device discovery — strong evidence.

Binary protocol parsing — strong evidence.

Signal handling — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Data Engineering

CSV generation — strong evidence.

NumPy numerical processing — strong evidence.

Pandas data loading/export — strong evidence.

Matrix construction — strong evidence.

Dataset consistency validation — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Visualization

Matplotlib — strong evidence.

Waterfall/heatmap visualization — strong evidence.

Automated PNG generation — strong evidence.

Multipage PDF reporting — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Experimental Engineering

Fixed-period scheduling — strong evidence.

Timing-offset measurement — strong evidence.

Timestamped experiment artifacts — strong evidence.

Acquisition/analysis separation — strong evidence.

Section: Capability Developed

The project represents a mature form of measurement automation: hardware is treated as a programmable data source, while acquisition timing, reproducibility, artifact naming, validation, and post-processing are all engineered into the workflow.

The significant capability is not merely reading a spectrum analyzer. It is building a repeatable RF experiment pipeline around it.','["tinysa","spectrum-analyzer","resolution-bandwidth","numpy","pandas","matplotlib","heatmap","engineering","practices","deterministic","output","organization","headless","plotting","graceful","stop","behavior","reusable","command-line","configuration","skills","demonstrated","instrumentation","systems"]','["Engineering Practices","Skills Demonstrated","Capability Developed"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-105-s045-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s045","section_path":["Engineering Practices","Deterministic Output Organization"],"section_title":"Deterministic Output Organization","source_file":"repositories/repo-105-RF-Power-Logging/README.md","source_line_end":330,"source_line_start":330,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Timestamped run directories and numbered sweep filenames make batches traceable.","text_sha256":"dc826ef1c34c571db756c972ce87d35aead5d238d084a5d31b77efb819881628","unit_id":"s045","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-105-s046-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s046","section_path":["Engineering Practices","Headless Plotting"],"section_title":"Headless Plotting","source_file":"repositories/repo-105-RF-Power-Logging/README.md","source_line_end":334,"source_line_start":334,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The acquisition tool selects the non-interactive Matplotlib `Agg` backend for automation-friendly output.","text_sha256":"d33b9d790bb988935ed75058739f84a253aa28af8dd540a889c69fdcb2b7042d","unit_id":"s046","word_count":12},{"block_id":"repo-105-s047-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s047","section_path":["Engineering Practices","Graceful Stop Behavior"],"section_title":"Gr