INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-106-rd004',106,'Satelitte-Project',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','mixed','repository_specific',0.363,7,278,'Section: Project Scope > Network Scan and Conditional Progression

The scan output is parsed into operator entries.

The target PLMN is searched explicitly.

If the target network is absent, the runner records an abort reason and stops before the manual-selection stage.

This conditional progression is important test engineering: later actions are not executed when the prerequisite network evidence is absent.

Section: Project Scope > Manual Operator Selection

When the target PLMN is visible, the harness attempts explicit manual selection using the configured access technology.

The command outcome is captured as a dedicated test case.

Section: Project Scope > Registration Monitoring

The registration stage performs repeated rounds of diagnostic sampling.

Each round captures information from commands including:

network clock;

operator selection;

EPS registration;

RSSI/BER;

Quectel signal-quality output;

RSRP;

serving-cell state;

system mode.

The script waits between unsuccessful rounds and stops early when registration succeeds.

Section: Project Scope > Success Diagnostics

On successful registration the harness additionally inspects:

PDP-context activation state;

assigned PDP addresses;

RRC state.

The report records whether context 1 is active and which IP address it received.

Section: Project Scope > State Restoration

The run contains a final restoration stage that returns the modem toward normal automatic operation.

That makes the test harness responsible not just for test setup and observation but also for post-test cleanup of the device state.

Section: Technical Stack > Python

Python implements the complete validation workflow, parsing layer, report generation, and device orchestration.

Section: Technical Stack > PySerial

PySerial opens the modem interface, controls buffers, writes AT commands, and collects modem responses.

Section: Technical Stack > Regular Expressions

Regex parsers extract structured state from modem responses such as:

IMSI and IMEI numbers;','["python","pdp-context","rsrp","pyserial","scope","network","scan","conditional","progression","manual","operator","selection","registration","monitoring","success","diagnostics","state","restoration","technical","stack","regular","expressions"]','["Project Scope","Technical Stack"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-106-s010-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s010","section_path":["Project Scope","Network Scan and Conditional Progression"],"section_title":"Network Scan and Conditional Progression","source_file":"repositories/repo-106-Satelitte-Project/README.md","source_line_end":105,"source_line_start":105,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The scan output is parsed into operator entries.","text_sha256":"aed6ca6a061c526784d3a152a26c45b1adae7d68ec3bdc2d885d111f9b00e2b6","unit_id":"s010","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-106-s010-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s010","section_path":["Project Scope","Network Scan and Conditional Progression"],"section_title":"Network Scan and Conditional Progression","source_file":"repositories/repo-106-Satelitte-Project/README.md","source_line_end":107,"source_line_start":107,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"The target PLMN is searched explicitly.","text_sha256":"e0d4a4522e17e8150d8e0efdef55e6def40537d9065cd5116f152d040dbdd7e7","unit_id":"s010","word_count":6},{"block_id":"repo-106-s010-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"repository_limitation","section_id":"s010","section_path":["Project Scope","Network Scan and Conditional Progression"],"section_title":"Network Scan and Conditional Progression","source_file":"repositories/repo-106-Satelitte-Project/README.md","source_line_end":109,"source_line_start":109,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"If the target network is a