INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-108-rd006',108,'Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.4516,32,280,'Section: Project Scope > ESP32 Sensor-Power Simulator

The implemented timing is a 30-second powered period within a three-minute cycle.

Section: Project Scope > Firebase Alert Posting

The ESP32 firmware uses HTTPClient and WiFiClientSecure to send JSON to a Firebase Realtime Database REST endpoint.

The alert payload includes:

kit owner;

sensor identifier;

Firebase server timestamp.

The firmware also reconnects to Wi-Fi if connectivity is lost before posting.

Section: Project Scope > Browser Alert Dashboard

index.html implements a responsive dashboard for displaying kit alerts.

The interface includes:

summary statistics;

searchable alert records;

timestamp presentation;

owner and sensor presentation;

live/new-alert visual treatment;

endpoint information;

login UI;

responsive table and card behavior.

The dashboard is designed as the observation surface for events generated by the simulated hardware path.

Section: Technical Stack > Python

Python implements the two desktop utilities:

Azure SQL gateway management;
MQTT hardware simulation.

Section: Technical Stack > CustomTkinter / Tkinter

Desktop interfaces provide login, CRUD forms, search, telemetry input, payload preview, status reporting, and logs.

Section: Technical Stack > Azure SQL and PyODBC

pyodbc connects to Azure SQL using ODBC Driver 18 with encrypted transport and certificate validation.

SQL handles schema creation, constrained operational fields, and CRUD persistence.

Section: Technical Stack > Paho MQTT

Paho MQTT simulates a device telemetry publisher against Azure IoT Hub.

Section: Technical Stack > TLS

The MQTT client uses TLS with certificate verification enabled and explicitly rejects insecure TLS mode.

Section: Technical Stack > ESP32 / Arduino Libraries

The embedded simulator uses:

WiFi.h;

HTTPClient.h;

WiFiClientSecure.h.

These support connectivity, HTTPS requests, and GPIO-driven test behavior.

Section: Technical Stack > HTML / CSS / JavaScript

The dashboard provides a responsive web interface around alert records and test-state presentation.','["python","html","javascript","tkinter","customtkinter","pyodbc","mqtt","esp32","wifi","scope","sensor-power","simulator","firebase","alert","posting","browser","dashboard","technical","stack","azure","paho","arduino","libraries"]','["Project Scope","Technical Stack"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-108-s013-b010","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s013","section_path":["Project Scope","ESP32 Sensor-Power Simulator"],"section_title":"ESP32 Sensor-Power Simulator","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":158,"source_line_start":158,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The implemented timing is a 30-second powered period within a three-minute cycle.","text_sha256":"703a5e0b74fc5fac1790673ad5763700a3ed585c9fdac1c83a20809b65b713d9","unit_id":"s013","word_count":12},{"block_id":"repo-108-s014-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":4,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s014","section_path":["Project Scope","Firebase Alert Posting"],"section_title":"Firebase Alert Posting","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":162,"source_line_start":162,"specificity_score":0.72,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The ESP32 firmware uses `HTTPClient` and `WiFiClientSecure` to send JSON to a Firebase Realtime Database REST endpoint.","text_sha256":"a17005fa5ccfd2df917d2c226909fa834243053a4efe5a97a1e41784b752afab","unit_id":"s014","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-108-s014-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s014","section_path":["Project Scope","Firebase Alert Posting"],"section_title":"Firebase Alert Posting","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":164,"source_line_s