3d6b19e547180c047877","unit_id":"s060","word_count":25},{"block_id":"repo-108-s060-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s060","section_path":["Capability Developed"],"section_title":"Capability Developed","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":436,"source_line_start":436,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It treats provisioning, simulated telemetry, periodic hardware behavior, cloud persistence, and operator visibility as connected validation concerns.","text_sha256":"a89849cdbb5ca4f740b94dbed9a778672140f08b4638579db1a48c5b319b3784","unit_id":"s060","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-108-s061-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s061","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":440,"source_line_start":440,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Earlier processed repositories contain embedded systems, Firebase applications, networking research, and hardware-control scripts.","text_sha256":"af13e412060c0dbcf0dedbd42613c7c8af3e32ba51bc008dc8d9560f59e1f41e","unit_id":"s061","word_count":13},{"block_id":"repo-108-s061-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s061","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":442,"source_line_start":442,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit` combines those strands in an operational IoT validation context with Azure SQL and Azure IoT Hub.","text_sha256":"985ddbbf667b613e5b49a89b2d650b817da4c8299807164ca66905d133d57340","unit_id":"s061","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-108-s061-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s061","section_path":["Portfolio Evolution Context"],"section_title":"Portfolio Evolution Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":444,"source_line_start":444,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The notable transition is from experimenting with individual technologies toward building technician-facing tools and controllable substitutes around a device lifecycle.","text_sha256":"642e9898edc3efa0955409c61af72c5923ca83e3d9e7e7c7d09d02fc7a3fd69d","unit_id":"s061","word_count":20},{"block_id":"repo-108-s062-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s062","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":450,"source_line_start":450,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"- an Azure SQL gateway provisioning log;","text_sha256":"d65c63a3968c23969ee31df79abafe6dd51ee2bbe0f8244e2fabba6f44a52f1a","unit_id":"s062","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-108-s062-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s062","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":451,"source_line_start":451,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"- an Azure IoT Hub MQTT hardware stub;","text_sha256":"e2c57ca20a3c39bbb6473bca5d13f4f094f6af4f303abc841a4653098d4df428","unit_id":"s062","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-108-s062-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s062","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":452,"source_line_start":452,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- ESP32-based periodic event simulation;","text_sha256":"2b8959a755608b92f9ac3738afa684228726aacd965acd7629fc5a59e07d2648","unit_id":"s062","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-108-s062-b005","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s062","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":453,"source_line_start":453,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- Firebase alert persistence;","text_sha256":"2232e5733e5cb3dbc0faa1b2afb4fc6bfbcb825d86c21f5e1e1d2ea5e03ec9cd","unit_id":"s062","word_count":4},{"block_id":"repo-108-s063-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s063","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":458,"source_line_start":458,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit` is an IoT engineering support suite built around gateway provisioning and hardware/cloud validation.","text_sha256":"01274f48f4499e30b7268415c0d75cdb3d5e8d7431dc84bcb4a5d45939d12146","unit_id":"s063","word_count":14},{"block_id":"repo-108-s063-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s063","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":460,"source_line_start":460,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"A CustomTkinter application manages structured gateway addition logs in Azure SQL, including SIM, BLE, LTE firmware, quality-control, deployment-purpose, and usage metadata. A separate Tkinter application simulates device telemetry into Azure IoT Hub using MQTT over TLS. An ESP32 program simulates periodic sensor-power activity and posts server-timestamped alerts into Firebase, while the browser dashboard provides an operator-facing view of those alerts.","text_sha256":"21433296fe3b05bb8c178ba2d86e52fec69491db6cf79df06238087674c70ef3","unit_id":"s063","word_count":60},{"block_id":"repo-108-s063-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s063","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":462,"source_line_start":462,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The strongest evidence is systems integration across the device lifecycle: relational provisioning records, cloud messaging, embedded simulation, validation logic, and observation tooling are all represented as practical test infrastructure.","text_sha256":"9cc804b5c5adcd601d80a665844e7c8e628e9c003f55a29f0dedadbc6a42cc60","unit_id":"s063","word_count":29},{"block_id":"repo-108-s064-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s064","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-108-Aquaseninsg-Auto-Test-Kit/README.md","source_line_end":468,"source_line_start":468,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `iot-test-toolkit`","text_sha256":"8fc5a0ac1bdc40f8378598e78e4ce5cc83bdb404d44b36106d4fcfc362394c18","unit_id":"s064","word_count":2},