s. A machine can measure a specific Wi-Fi, 5G, Ethernet, or USB-network path while using another internet-capable interface to report results without accidentally changing which interface the throughput test exercises.","text_sha256":"a691bfdb0b9bb815df19e2517d489a9c60648e24c29940449c15eee9c2841c43","unit_id":"s004","word_count":35},{"block_id":"repo-109-s004-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s004","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":41,"source_line_start":41,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The Python application manages the measurement run and produces timestamp-rich records. The browser application consumes those records, groups them by explicit stream identity, and plots them on synchronized timelines.","text_sha256":"1ca889f8e1794d6c85c121c63d1fcd005a49449d9790aa3e9ee17caa15be2bc5","unit_id":"s004","word_count":29},{"block_id":"repo-109-s006-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":4,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s006","section_path":["Project Scope","Desktop Measurement Agent"],"section_title":"Desktop Measurement Agent","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":47,"source_line_start":47,"specificity_score":0.72,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`perfer.py` implements a Tkinter-based iperf3 client agent.","text_sha256":"d538568cf6ff170c40c5114e4bf85836bd302c1c2f98eeaa3df2b49b860560a0","unit_id":"s006","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-109-s006-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s006","section_path":["Project Scope","Desktop Measurement Agent"],"section_title":"Desktop Measurement Agent","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":49,"source_line_start":49,"specificity_score"