Firebase stores interval-level measurement telemetry used by the web dashboard.','["technical","stack","firebase","realtime","database"]','["Technical Stack"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-109-s036-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s036","section_path":["Technical Stack","Firebase Realtime Database"],"section_title":"Firebase Realtime Database","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":361,"source_line_start":361,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Firebase stores interval-level measurement telemetry used by the web dashboard.","text_sha256":"781295d9c1196400df6794eb64f9e8452002d8755924ff56e558df9f7e89c7f0","unit_id":"s036","word_count":10}]','{"analysis_source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","document_text_sha256":"087bc816e60d55d0de9597a5cd993fbee61e533917ecd6ede9ab5ca9e118d073","earliest_source_line":361,"embedding_text_sha256":"7ebbe03db47e89ff6081bd8e5c72b5aa62a9cc5bea7d33ff4387ecf4892e3f2f","normalized_input":"rag-corpus/repositories.jsonl","repository_raw_sha256":"e0016cb4e34f2fa845dab3c798be2d240e18b7d242b662a3045fdec02deaeb0e","repository_source_line_end":616,"repository_source_line_start":1}');
INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-109-rd009',109,'RobohubDemo',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3711,8,333,'Section: Major Engineering Work > Queue-Based Concurrency

The reader, poster, and GUI communicate through queues and background threads.

Remote telemetry latency therefore does not need to block measurement-output parsing.

Section: Major Engineering Work > Schema Compatibility

The dashboard accepts multiple historical aliases while still maintaining one canonical internal sample representation.

Section: Engineering Practices > Separation of Measurement and Reporting Paths

The architecture makes routing assumptions explicit instead of leaving them implicit in the operating system.

Section: Engineering Practices > Separation of Reader and Poster Work

A queued worker model prevents telemetry POSTs from being performed synchronously inside the iperf output-reading loop.

Section: Engineering Practices > Traceability

Raw iperf lines and multiple timestamp layers remain attached to the telemetry record.

Section: Engineering Practices > Local and Remote Persistence

Runs are retained locally in CSV while also being published remotely for visualization.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Network Measurement

iperf3 automation — strong evidence.

Downlink/reverse-mode throughput testing — strong evidence.

TCP/UDP measurement — strong evidence.

Parallel-stream handling — strong evidence.

Explicit interface binding — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Concurrency

Threaded subprocess/POST workflow — strong evidence.
Queue-based producer/consumer design — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Data Engineering

Interval parsing — strong evidence.

Timestamp reconstruction — strong evidence.

Telemetry normalization — strong evidence.

Schema compatibility handling — strong evidence.

CSV logging — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Experimental Engineering

Synchronized measurement timelines — strong evidence.

Measurement/reporting path separation — strong evidence.

Finite and continuous experiment modes — strong evidence.

Section: Capability Developed

RobohubDemo demonstrates a systems-level view of network measurement.

The project does not treat throughput as only a number returned by iperf3. It treats route selection, interface identity, measurement timestamps, telemetry delivery, stream identity, synchronization, and visualization as parts of the measurement system.

Section: Portfolio Evolution Context

Earlier networking repositories already contain iperf3 acquisition and synchronized wireless analysis.

RobohubDemo makes the live measurement pipeline more explicit by publishing interval-level results into a realtime datastore and separating the probe interface from the reporting interface.','["iperf3","throughput","major","engineering","work","queue-based","concurrency","schema","compatibility","practices","separation","measurement","reporting","paths","reader","poster","traceability","local","remote","persistence","skills","demonstrated","network","data"]','["Major Engineering Work","Engineering Practices","Skills Demonstrated","Capability Developed","Portfolio Evolution Context"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-109-s043-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s043","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Queue-Based Concurrency"],"section_title":"Queue-Based Concurrency","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":394,"source_line_start":394,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The reader, poster, and GUI communicate through queues and background threads.","text_sha256":"407a6b3eb66c5a32a6d5f11f28ba30f045f4adb39803ad530de6c401a9dead42","unit_id":"s043","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-109-s043-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s043","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Queue-Based Concurrency"],"section_title":"Queue-Based Concurrency","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":396,"source_line_start":396,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Remote telemetry latency therefore does not need to block measurement-output parsing.","text_sha256":"443c915d2400e377f9fb12fedf496582cf6b68a53ca06a352e0815a4cdcb0b58","unit_id":"s043","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-109-s044-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s044","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Schema Com