,"section_id":"s072","section_path":["Historical Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":541,"source_line_start":541,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"- Firebase HTTP telemetry is source-bound to another selected interface;","text_sha256":"08e6e48ab72ed489b786d7a65527010745f70774e6348b388d3840415e297c97","unit_id":"s072","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-109-s073-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s073","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":547,"source_line_start":547,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`RobohubDemo` is a network experiment system that couples an iperf3 desktop agent with a realtime browser visualization layer.","text_sha256":"348d5836e375b6a6ee9cf330748481792256df862ec729f99a258570eed116da","unit_id":"s073","word_count":18},{"block_id":"repo-109-s073-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":4,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s073","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":549,"source_line_start":549,"specificity_score":0.72,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The Python application discovers interfaces, lets the operator choose separate measurement and telemetry routes, constructs finite or infinite TCP/UDP reverse-mode iperf3 tests, parses interval throughput, reconstructs measurement timestamps, computes running statistics, stores CSV output, and asynchronously posts detailed telemetry to Firebase.","text_sha256":"b90c4eef9431d68361477dbabf66e05cfe1d45c02c7f69e22521e78095a98e7a","unit_id":"s073","word_count":41},{"block_id":"repo-109-s073-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s073","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":551,"source_line_start":551,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The browser application normalizes incoming records, groups them strictly by explicit stream identity, aligns their measurement timestamps, renders Chart.js plots, and exposes diagnostics for grouping and timestamp interpretation.","text_sha256":"b73709c534e5f42761d6673193a4cc78961b5f9ea9431c5ae708a304cceebf57","unit_id":"s073","word_count":28},{"block_id":"repo-109-s073-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s073","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":553,"source_line_start":553,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The strongest engineering evidence is the explicit modeling of measurement correctness. The code recognizes that the network path being tested, the path used to report the result, the time the measurement occurred, and the logical identity of the stream are separate concerns that must all remain controlled and inspectable.","text_sha256":"88973d1d1a448783ee277fa14a9d3d1f16d5694521cbcf75b6ee4bfbed528c2a","unit_id":"s073","word_count":49},{"block_id":"repo-109-s074-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s074","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-109-RobohubDemo/README.md","source_line_end":559,"source_line_start":559,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `network-measurement-tool`","text_sha25