INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-110-rd004',110,'CV-Highly-Organized',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','deployment_operations','positive','repository_specific',0.4351,12,158,'Section: Automated PDF Build Pipeline > GitHub Actions Trigger

Build CV PDFs runs on:

pushes to main affecting **/*.tex;

changes to the workflow itself;

manual workflow_dispatch.

The path filter prevents unrelated changes from needlessly recompiling the document set.

Section: Automated PDF Build Pipeline > Multi-CV Compilation

The workflow uses xu-cheng/latex-action@v4 with:

root pattern **/main.tex;

compilation in each root file''s own directory;

Debian environment;

current TeX Live;

failure propagation rather than silently ignoring compile failures.

The pattern allows all role-specific CVs to be built through one workflow.

Section: Automated PDF Build Pipeline > Generated Artifact Commit

After compilation, the workflow searches recursively for main.pdf, stages them, checks whether any PDF actually changed, and exits cleanly when there is nothing to commit.

When changes exist, it configures the GitHub Actions bot identity, commits the generated PDFs, and pushes them back to the repository.

This creates a source-plus-built-artifact workflow in which users can retrieve a current PDF without compiling LaTeX locally.','["latex","search","automated","build","pipeline","github","actions","trigger","multi-cv","compilation","generated","artifact","commit"]','["Automated PDF Build Pipeline"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-110-s010-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s010","section_path":["Automated PDF Build Pipeline","GitHub Actions Trigger"],"section_title":"GitHub Actions Trigger","source_file":"repositories/repo-110-CV-Highly-Organized/README.md","source_line_end":102,"source_line_start":102,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"`Build CV PDFs` runs on:","text_sha256":"ad75b12cd9b84e64f51d77177a26a97c8702411996ec659d2090a3ee529b303b","unit_id":"s010","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-110-s010-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s010","section_path":["Automated PDF Build Pipeline","GitHub Actions Trigger"],"section_title":"GitHub Actions Trigger","source_file":"repositories/repo-110-CV-Highly-Organized/README.md","source_line_end":104,"source_line_start":104,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- pushes to `main` affecting `**/*.tex`;","text_sha256":"cb83b1810b10b6682c6336ab88f6d36479f4e2f3f2b528a120faf4c60459e802","unit_id":"s010","word_count":6},{"block_id":"repo-110-s010-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s010","section_path":["Automated PDF Build Pipeline","GitHub Actions Trigger"],"section_title":"GitHub Actions Trigger","source_file":"repositories/repo-110-CV-Highly-Organized/README.md","source_line_end":105,"source_line_start":105,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- changes to the workflow itself;","text_sha256":"00a4c1e2febc509189c04e284dc174ca13ba1bc7e82d396471c9c344a8a96423","unit_id"