INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-110-rd009',110,'CV-Highly-Organized',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3912,13,344,'Section: Major Engineering Work > Cache-Then-Refresh Behavior

Fresh-enough cached hierarchy data can render immediately while a remote synchronization follows in the background.

Section: Major Engineering Work > Artifact-Oriented UX

The interface is optimized around one concrete user task: locate a career-specific CV and download the current built PDF.

Section: Engineering Practices > Single-Branch Multi-Variant Organization

Directories, rather than branches, represent active CV variants.

Section: Engineering Practices > Source / Artifact Pairing

Each CV keeps editable source and generated output colocated.

Section: Engineering Practices > Derived Navigation

The frontend derives its data model from repository state rather than a duplicated manual category list.

Section: Engineering Practices > Bounded Browser Caching

The application gives repository metadata a finite cache lifetime and refreshes in the background.

Section: Auxiliary nRF RSSI Measurement Utility

The repository also contains tesp.py, a separate Python desktop measurement tool.

This utility is not part of the CV build/browser architecture, but it is substantive repository evidence and is therefore preserved as an auxiliary capability.

Section: Auxiliary nRF RSSI Measurement Utility > Physical Board Detection

The script enumerates serial ports and identifies likely nRF/J-Link/CMSIS-DAP interfaces.

Multiple serial interfaces exposed by one physical debugger board are grouped using identifiers such as:

serial number;

physical USB location;

HWID-derived serial/location data.

This avoids treating multiple CDC interfaces as multiple physical nRF boards.

Section: Auxiliary nRF RSSI Measurement Utility > UART Interface Probing

For each physical board, candidate serial interfaces are opened briefly and probed for readable output.

If one interface clearly produces UART data, it is selected automatically.

Ambiguous cases fall back to explicit operator selection.

Section: Auxiliary nRF RSSI Measurement Utility > Timestamped Run Artifacts

Measurement runs are placed into uniquely timestamped folders.

Section: Auxiliary nRF RSSI Measurement Utility > RSSI Parsing and Visualization

The program identifies RSSI values from incoming text and uses PySide6 plus pyqtgraph for live desktop visualization.

Section: Auxiliary nRF RSSI Measurement Utility > Cutoff Events

The source defines a CutoffEvent model representing transitions in which the leading board changes, retaining:

event number;

timestamp;

elapsed time;

previous/new leader;

both RSSI values;

pre-cutoff gap;','["python","cache-then-refresh","j-link","pyside6","pyqtgraph","rssi","major","engineering","work","behavior","artifact-oriented","practices","single-branch","multi-variant","organization","source","artifact","pairing","derived","navigation","bounded","browser","caching","auxiliary"]','["Major Engineering Work","Engineering Practices","Auxiliary nRF RSSI Measurement Utility"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-110-s038-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s038","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Cache-Then-Refresh Behavior"],"section_title":"Cache-Then-Refresh Behavior","source_file":"repositories/repo-110-CV-Highly-Organized/README.md","source_line_end":326,"source_line_start":326,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Fresh-enough cached hierarchy data can render immediately while a remote synchronization follows in the background.","text_sha256":"e34decffece9f4a8bc54f62f733498023a68089423a82c5b9ef5e2672e7ad20a","unit_id":"s038","word_count":15},{"block_id":"repo-110-s040-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s040","section_path":["Major Engineering Work","Artifact-Oriented UX"],"section_title":"Artifact-Oriented UX","source_file":"repositories/repo-110-CV-Highly-Organized/README.md","source_line_end":334,"source_line_start":334,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The interface is optimized around one concrete user task: locate a career-specific CV and download the current built PDF.","text_sha256":"6d21fdebdf07b421c140ed572cc72e6586b0c8b05860df3288c9c58e163f406a","unit_id":"s040","word_count":19},{"block_id":"repo-110-s046-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s046","section_path":["Engineering Practices","Single-Branch Multi-Variant Organization"],"section_title":"Single-Branch Multi-Variant Organization","source_file