INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-111-rd010',111,'MegaRepo',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.4428,17,312,'Section: Skills Demonstrated > Go

Struct and method design — strong evidence.

JSON file persistence — strong evidence.

Slice filtering/sorting — strong evidence.

Time handling — strong evidence.

Error handling — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Ruby

Class-based domain modeling — strong evidence.

JSON persistence — strong evidence.

Enumerable collection operations — strong evidence.

Stateful borrow/return workflow — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > PHP

Strictly typed PHP — strong evidence.

Typed object modeling — strong evidence.

JSON persistence — strong evidence.

Inventory calculations/filtering — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Rust

Basic stdin/string handling — limited direct evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > General Software Engineering

CLI application design — strong evidence.

Input validation — strong evidence.

Local JSON persistence — strong evidence.

Temporary-file replacement — strong evidence.

Search/filter/statistics workflows — strong evidence.

Section: Capability Developed

MegaRepo is useful primarily as cross-language implementation practice.

The repeated application patterns expose how comparable concerns—domain objects, state mutation, persistence, validation, and CLI interaction—are expressed differently in Go, Ruby, PHP, and Rust.

Section: Portfolio Evolution Context

The processed corpus already contains extensive C/C++, Java, Python, JavaScript, and other language experience.

This repository adds direct implementation evidence for Go, Ruby, PHP, and Rust within one focused practice workspace, with substantially more depth in Go/Ruby/PHP than in the Rust file.

Section: Historical Significance

Within the processed corpus so far, MegaRepo is the clearest single repository explicitly practicing several server/general-purpose languages side by side through small stateful applications.

Section: Overall Repository Narrative

MegaRepo is a multi-language practice workspace containing a Go task manager, Ruby library manager, PHP inventory manager, and small Rust console exercise.

The Go, Ruby, and PHP programs all implement persistent local state, domain rules, search/filtering, input validation, and menu-driven interaction while using the idioms of their respective languages. Their repeated temporary-file-plus-rename persistence pattern also shows attention to safer state replacement rather than direct destructive overwrites.','["ruby","rust","json","skills","demonstrated","general","software","engineering","capability","developed","portfolio","evolution","context","historical","significance","narrative"]','["Skills Demonstrated","Capability Developed","Portfolio Evolution Context","Historical Significance","Overall Repository Narrative"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-111-s048-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s048","section_path":["Skills Demonstrated","Go"],"section_title":"Go","source_file":"repositories/repo-111-MegaRepo/README.md","source_line_end":363,"source_line_start":363,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"- **Struct and method design — strong evidence.**","text_sha256":"3bb37e53d2a276b23dbc21bb4b505df6a473fada741970ae3ddafe1ea9522a1c","unit_id":"s048","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-111-s048-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s048","section_path":["Skills Demonstrated","Go"],"section_title":"Go","source_file":"repositories/repo-111-MegaRepo/README.md","source_line_end":364,"source_line_start":364,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"- **JSON file persistence — strong evidence.**","text_sha256":"c717a1e51f4ae04382c077bb3eb236263a06c1e3f3baf5526b1cb26016c3ea1e","unit_id":"s048","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-111-s048-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s048","section_path":["Skills Demonstrated","Go"],"section_title":"Go","source_file":"repositories/repo-111-MegaRepo/README.md","source_line_