INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-113-rd002',113,'my-portfolio',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','authorship_provenance','positive','repository_specific',0.3954,43,210,'Section: Collaboration and Authorship Context

The repository is owner-driven and integrates the public portfolio, administration workspace, Cloudflare Worker API, D1 schema, RAG runtime, CI/CD configuration, production-quality-control records, and the Kiro 3D agent interface in one codebase.

Those copied/generated career-evidence documents are not treated here as independent proof that this repository authored the underlying earlier projects.

The personally attributable evidence from my-portfolio is instead the software that:

builds, validates, publishes, retrieves, reranks, and presents the portfolio evidence corpus;

drives the Three.js/Mixamo avatar from the real RAG lifecycle.

Cloudflare, GitHub, Netlify, React, Vite, Three.js, and model providers are external platforms/libraries.

The engineering evidence is in the repository-specific architecture, integration, validation, migration decisions, orchestration, tests, frontend behavior, and operational safeguards built around those services.

Section: Evidence Basis

package.json;

wrangler.jsonc;

.github/workflows/portfolio-ci-cd.yml;

worker/index.ts;

worker/auth.ts;

worker/milestones-repository.ts;

worker/opinions-repository.ts;

worker/validation.ts;

worker/rag-runtime.ts;

worker/__tests__/;

migrations/0001-initial-portfolio-schema.sql through 0005-rag-runtime.sql;

src/admin/;

src/features/kiro-rag/;

rag/runtime/build-d1-rag-import.mjs;

Where a historical artifact conflicts with current code, current implementation is authoritative and the evolution is documented explicitly.

Section: Browser-Origin Restrictions

The Worker marks security-sensitive browser routes as restricted.

This group includes:

/api/admin/*;

/api/rag/*;

/api/auth/exchange;

/api/auth/session;

opinion submission.

The request origin is checked before those routes execute.

Preflight responses use the same restricted/public distinction.

This complements bearer authentication by controlling which browser origin is expected to exercise sensitive application paths.','["vite","wrangler","netlify","collaboration","authorship","context","basis","browser-origin","restrictions"]','["Collaboration and Authorship Context","Evidence Basis","Browser-Origin Restrictions"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-113-s002-b001","canonical_categories":["authorship_attribution"],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s002","section_path":["Collaboration and Authorship Context"],"section_title":"Collaboration and Authorship Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":23,"source_line_start":23,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository is owner-driven and integrates the public portfolio, administration workspace, Cloudflare Worker API, D1 schema, RAG runtime, CI/CD configuration, production-quality-control records, and the Kiro 3D agent interface in one codebase.","text_sha256":"bda934b2ad4fd40466fe31e20572987bbc7122587240ac15e6a28bff0d9d601e","unit_id":"s002","word_count":31},{"block_id":"repo-113-s002-b003","canonical_categories":["authorship_attribution"],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s002","section_path":["Collaboration and Authorship Context"],"section_title":"Collaboration and Authorship Context","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":27,"source_line_start":27,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Those copied/generated career-evidence documents are not treated here as independent proof that this repository authored the underlying earlier projects.","text_sha256":"70d00787cfd96907011256b212c11b7997a847b4fa4b78e99c2877b94ad2fb4c","unit_id":"s002","word_count":19},{"block_id":"repo-113-s002-b004","canonical_categories":["authorship_attribution"],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_in