INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-113-rd003',113,'my-portfolio',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','interpretive',0.335,6,290,'Section: What This Project Is

my-portfolio is a deployable personal career platform rather than a static résumé site.

The product''s unusual architectural feature is that it consumes structured evidence derived from the broader repository portfolio and exposes that evidence through a retrieval system designed to preserve provenance and uncertainty.

Section: Current System Shape

The deployed system is organized as:

The RAG request path adds:

The streaming endpoint returns the same retrieval context through Server-Sent Events before and during generation.

Section: Public Milestone Content Model > Milestone Records

D1 stores milestone-level fields including:

unique slug;

year;

month;

title;

short description;

expanded description;

detail Markdown;

display order;

publication state;

publication timestamp;

creation/update timestamps.

Section: Public Milestone Content Model > Ordered Long-Form Sections

Milestones can own ordered content sections with:

optional heading;

Markdown body;

deterministic display order.

This allows a timeline item to expand into a richer career story without changing the top-level milestone schema for every paragraph.

Section: Public Milestone Content Model > Published / Draft Boundary

Public milestone listing filters to is_published = 1.

Public milestone detail also requires the requested milestone to be published.

The admin path can access both draft and published records.

Section: Public Milestone Content Model > Publication Timestamp Semantics

When a milestone is first published, the service records a publication timestamp.

Editing an already-published milestone preserves the existing publication timestamp.

Unpublishing clears the public timestamp.

That treats publication as a lifecycle state rather than an arbitrary boolean with no history context.

Section: D1 Image Storage > Architectural Migration Away from R2

The initial D1 schema represented milestone images through an r2_key.

A later migration explicitly renames the legacy image table, recreates it with Base64 image columns, migrates the schema boundary, and removes the old R2 table.','["system","shape","public","milestone","content","model","records","ordered","long-form","sections","published","draft","boundary","publication","timestamp","semantics","image","storage","architectural","migration","away","from"]','["What This Project Is","Current System Shape","Public Milestone Content Model","D1 Image Storage"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-113-s004-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s004","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":70,"source_line_start":70,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`my-portfolio` is a deployable personal career platform rather than a static résumé site.","text_sha256":"4ecdd627e4d20ebc3b4f1f4b53bf8f193f65e1258013c494f239bd5bc756b867","unit_id":"s004","word_count":13},{"block_id":"repo-113-s004-b007","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s004","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":79,"source_line_start":79,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The product''s unusual architectural feature is that it consumes structured evidence derived from the broader repository portfolio and exposes that evidence through a retrieval system designed to preserve provenance and uncertainty.","text_sha256":"fe3b7973d0b9fc8cd6d8106fd2547fe9db058d638824c204a9f260ad80059c11","unit_id":"s004","word_count":31},{"block_id":"repo-113-s005-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s005","section_path":["Curren