n","section_id":"s037","section_path":["GitHub OAuth Administrator Model","Exchange Consumption"],"section_title":"Exchange Consumption","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":415,"source_line_start":415,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"A missing or expired exchange code is rejected.","text_sha256":"85a68143f6dd28e19fb648cfb4eb698c4170d6e1dc573648e00e56667fda364e","unit_id":"s037","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-113-s037-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s037","section_path":["GitHub OAuth Administrator Model","Exchange Consumption"],"section_title":"Exchange Consumption","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":417,"source_line_start":417,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This creates an explicit short-lived handoff between third-party OAuth and application session issuance.","text_sha256":"af7765bbee9b7d5868d94dbbf598d8062820946415dc05a45761d2c810818283","unit_id":"s037","word_count":13},{"block_id":"repo-113-s039-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s039","section_path":["GitHub OAuth Administrator Model","Secret Strength Requirement"],"section_title":"Secret Strength Requirement","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":444,"source_line_start":444,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`SESSION_SECRET` must contain at least 32 characters.","text_sha256":"45080d04f34d058423f5cb01eed6facc786949ce54fd3e29ed46993ed0bfb952","unit_id":"s039","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-113-s039-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s039","section_path":["GitHub OAuth Administrator Model","Secret Strength Requirement"],"section_title":"Secret Strength Requirement","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":446,"source_line_start":446,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Missing OAuth/session configuration produces explicit service-configuration failures rather than silently weakening authentication.","text_sha256":"f53b405b0171278634f45118dcf00a6a42992d3844e65dc3a48a8b5f7a9414d8","unit_id":"s039","word_count":12},{"block_id":"repo-113-s049-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s049","section_path":["Admin Workspace","Milestone Authoring"],"section_title":"Milestone Authoring","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":524,"source_line_start":524,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The React admin workspace supports portfolio maintenance without direct D1 editing.","text_sha256":"55bd9413496137205dff500e4943c95704d276d6377a99a7f5b2837c8d8320e4","unit_id":"s049","word_count":11}]','{"analysis_source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","document_text_sha256":"97152040308a931959dea1026ea713e03a3e09ac0b9502d16038fe29c0adaf78","earliest_source_line":301,"embedding_text_sha256":"a9914666bac3f49e340eeee21089d9d2af4141d5efee6fa3d9fa40c1b4f02045","normalized_input":"rag-corpus/repositories.jsonl","repository_raw_sha256":"c810ad7a8b5f56454bb2fbdbf6ee906314b32aa8271c9da3e7180df11d24b307","repository_source_line_end":2019,"repository_source_line_start":1}');
INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-113-rd008',113,'my-portfolio',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','architecture_system_design','positive','repository_specific',0.4185,30,200,'Section: Cloudflare Worker API > Worker Entry Point

worker/index.ts is the application API entry point.

It separates request handling into:

public routes;

authentication routes;

administration routes;

RAG routes.

Repository modules isolate persistent milestone and opinion behavior from the routing layer.

Section: Cloudflare Worker API > Public API Surface

Implemented public routes include:

GET /api/health;

GET /api/milestones;

GET /api/milestones/:slug;

GET /api/images/:id;

GET /api/opinions;

POST /api/opinions;

GET /api/rag/health;

POST /api/rag/query;

POST /api/rag/query/stream.

Section: Cloudflare Worker API > Administration API Surface

Authenticated administration supports:

list milestones;

create milestones;

load one milestone;

update milestones;

delete milestones;

replace ordered milestone sections;

replace image sets;

add one image;

delete one image;

list opinion submissions;

approve/reject opinions;

delete opinions.

Section: Cloudflare Worker API > Health Endpoint

The general health endpoint executes a D1 query before reporting success.

This checks the application''s persistence path rather than returning a constant response.

Section: Synchronous RAG API

POST /api/rag/query performs the full retrieval and generation chain and returns:

answer;

citations;

retrieval diagnostics;

cited evidence labels;

grounding warning;

model identities.

The production acceptance record dated 2026-09-06 validates this synchronous path end to end.

Section: Streaming RAG API > Server-Sent Events

POST /api/rag/query/stream performs the same retrieval/reranking path and then requests streamed generation.','["cloudflare","worker","entry","point","public","surface","administration","health","endpoint","synchronous","streaming","server-sent","events"]','["Cloudflare Worker API","Synchronous RAG API","Streaming RAG API"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-113-s026-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Cloudflare Worker API","Worker Entry Point"],"section_title":"Worker Entry Point","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":310,"source_line_start":310,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`worker/index.ts` is the application API entry point.","text_sha256":"78d59ad2e1f75e7f5124b68e1e82cc03b5f1b0696cc67a4461c382a1d25303d3","unit_id":"s026","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-113-s026-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Cloudflare Worker API","Worker Entry Point"],"section_title":"Worker Entry Point","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":312,"source_line_start":312,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"It separates request handling into:","text_sha256":"017a931a558d4bdc77b053165f53574eb318ac0be5b753d3af9e0f5c8f9fe707","unit_id":"s026","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-113-s026-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Cloudflare Worker API","Worker Entry Point"],"section_title":"Worker Entry Point","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":314,"source_line_start":314,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- public routes;","text_sha256":"de031dfbd95e5179554ac121bcb5fa184f8cd8d661c51fad2bb2e369d82d500d","unit_id":"s026","word_count":3},{