INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-113-rd019',113,'my-portfolio',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3629,9,248,'Section: Grounded Generation > Reasoning-Content Boundary

A reasoning-only response with no visible answer is treated as invalid.

The same rule is applied to streaming deltas.

Section: RAG Citation Model

Each selected evidence item is converted to a citation object containing:

evidence label;

document ID;

repository index;

repository name;

repository URL;

retrieval class;

semantic area;

polarity;

evidence level;

specificity score;

dense score;

rerank score;

source-fragment provenance.

Source fragments can preserve:

section title;

section path;

source line start/end;

text SHA-256.

This allows the frontend to expose not only “which repository,” but where the retrieved evidence came from inside its analyzed source.

Section: RAG Grounding Warning

After generation, the runtime extracts valid [E#] labels from the answer.

If no valid evidence citation is emitted, the response still returns the evidence but sets a grounding warning.

This distinguishes “retrieval supplied grounding” from “the generated prose actually cited it.”

Section: Browser RAG Client > SSE Parser

rag-client.ts implements browser-side parsing for named SSE frames.

It supports CRLF/LF frame boundaries and multi-line data payload handling.

Malformed JSON reports which RAG event failed to parse and retains the underlying error as a cause.

Section: Browser RAG Client > Abort Support

The streaming request accepts an AbortSignal.

The chat owns an AbortController for the active turn.

The user can stop generation instead of being forced to wait for completion.

Section: Browser RAG Client > Incomplete Stream Detection

If the stream terminates without a done event and was not intentionally aborted, the client reports an incomplete-stream error.','["grounded","generation","reasoning-content","boundary","citation","model","grounding","warning","browser","client","parser","abort","support","incomplete","stream","detection"]','["Grounded Generation","RAG Citation Model","RAG Grounding Warning","Browser RAG Client"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-113-s076-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s076","section_path":["Grounded Generation","Reasoning-Content Boundary"],"section_title":"Reasoning-Content Boundary","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":793,"source_line_start":793,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"A reasoning-only response with no visible answer is treated as invalid.","text_sha256":"dbf0c66b1e0469f9f23838b7f09153fda0b6e1ae4b37a69673c8b854cb4d1331","unit_id":"s076","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-113-s076-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s076","section_path":["Grounded Generation","Reasoning-Content Boundary"],"section_title":"Reasoning-Content Boundary","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":795,"source_line_start":795,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The same rule is applied to streaming deltas.","text_sha256":"6d4d476778ea632d07b89ef9bdf0283d9316b7d152d6ef4b61700cdf450969c6","unit_id":"s076","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-113-s077-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s077","section_path":["RAG Citation Model"],"section_title":"RAG Citation Model","source_file":"repositories/repo-113-my-portfolio/README.md","source_line_end":799,"source_line_start":799,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Each selected evidence item is co