INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-114-rd006',114,'KiroQuestionsBank',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3642,8,214,'Section: Portable Category Package > File Suffix

.kiroq.json.

The file remains ordinary JSON while carrying a recognizable application-specific suffix.

Section: Portable Category Package > IDs Deliberately Excluded

Exported categories omit database IDs.

The exported package contains logical content:

names;

descriptions;

question types;

Markdown bodies;

explanations;

option text;

correctness.

Fresh UUIDs are generated on import.

This avoids coupling portable content to one D1 installation''s identifiers.

Section: Portable Category Package > Order Preserved Structurally

Array order represents:

subcategory order;

question order;

option order.

On import, array indexes become explicit relational position values.

This translates portable ordered JSON into queryable ordered relational data.

Section: Versioned Interchange Design

The importer requires:

An unsupported version is rejected explicitly.

A wrong package kind is also rejected explicitly.

The design therefore leaves room for future transport evolution without forcing all stored database rows into an opaque versioned JSON payload.

Section: Import Validation > Whole-Document Validation Before Write Construction

validateCategoryImport() traverses the complete incoming structure before the Worker constructs persistence statements.

It validates:

top-level object shape;

schema version;

package kind;

category object;

category name;

optional category description;

subcategory array;

each subcategory object;

subcategory name/description;

each question;

each option;

question-type rules.

Section: Import Validation > Reuse of Question Validation

Imported questions use the same validateQuestion() logic as questions created through the normal API.','["portable","category","package","file","suffix","deliberately","excluded","order","preserved","structurally","versioned","interchange","design","import","validation","whole-document","before","write","construction","reuse","question"]','["Portable Category Package","Versioned Interchange Design","Import Validation"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-114-s025-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s025","section_path":["Portable Category Package","File Suffix"],"section_title":"File Suffix","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":310,"source_line_start":310,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"`.kiroq.json`.","text_sha256":"4602ce3e003cdc71f745ce64573265856983d02ddb56683cacba8e4ace3c6e05","unit_id":"s025","word_count":1},{"block_id":"repo-114-s025-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s025","section_path":["Portable Category Package","File Suffix"],"section_title":"File Suffix","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":312,"source_line_start":312,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The file remains ordinary JSON while carrying a recognizable application-specific suffix.","text_sha256":"db1e77fbd68a23939871b97d5d8a22b474c6a6ac4fd940e4df87ac8e0052e691","unit_id":"s025","word_count":11},{"block_id":"repo-114-s026-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s026","section_path":["Portable Category Package","IDs Deliberately Excluded"],"section_title":"IDs Deliberately Excluded","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":316,"source_line_start":316,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"Exporte