INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-114-rd019',114,'KiroQuestionsBank',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3667,8,215,'Section: Portability Design

The .kiroq.json format makes a category transferable without requiring:

original D1 row IDs;

direct database export;

access to the source installation.

Because the package is normal JSON, it can also be:

generated by scripts;

reviewed manually;

stored in source control;

produced by AI-assisted question-generation workflows;

validated through the same importer.

The example file in examples/ documents the expected package structure as a concrete artifact.

Section: Data Integrity Behaviors

The implementation combines multiple integrity layers:

Section: Data Integrity Behaviors > TypeScript Validation

question type validation;

non-empty strings;

nullable-string normalization;

option cardinality;

correctness cardinality;

import package version/kind validation.

Section: Data Integrity Behaviors > SQL Constraints

non-null IDs/names/bodies;

constrained question type;

constrained correctness bit;

foreign keys;

cascade deletion.

Section: Data Integrity Behaviors > Ordered Write Logic

next subcategory/question position derived explicitly;

import positions derived from arrays;

option position persisted explicitly.

This gives the data model more structure than a frontend-only question-list representation.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > TypeScript and Full-Stack Development

TypeScript — strong evidence.

React 19 — strong evidence.

Hono — strong evidence.

shared frontend/backend contracts — strong evidence.

browser API integration — strong evidence.

error-state handling — strong evidence.

Section: Skills Demonstrated > Import / Export Engineering

versioned JSON schema — strong evidence.

portable package design — strong evidence.

database-ID-independent export — strong evidence.','["typescript","hono","portability","design","data","integrity","behaviors","validation","constraints","ordered","write","logic","skills","demonstrated","full-stack","development","import","export","engineering"]','["Portability Design","Data Integrity Behaviors","Skills Demonstrated"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-114-s077-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s077","section_path":["Portability Design"],"section_title":"Portability Design","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":907,"source_line_start":907,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The `.kiroq.json` format makes a category transferable without requiring:","text_sha256":"2870002cc295e92036b2aee483c108ee3cff859df0f4e1f4321afaef89e02f11","unit_id":"s077","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-114-s077-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s077","section_path":["Portability Design"],"section_title":"Portability Design","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":909,"source_line_start":909,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- original D1 row IDs;","text_sha256":"007b6d319463a2becd475cf448c2ca1d49b7d359285c04710bd87b635b9dbc29","unit_id":"s077","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-114-s077-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s077","section_path":["Portability Design"],"section_title":"Portability Design","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":910,"source_line_start":910,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- direct database export;","text_sha256":"534dca5f1f13d8b747dad3d021478a7d87a48defbbd69c811c761e0ed958cf5f","unit_id":"s077","word_count":4},{"block_id":"repo-114-s077-b00