text":"Shared TypeScript validation is reused between ordinary question creation and imported questions, preventing the import path from bypassing MCQ/multi-select correctness rules. SQL constraints and foreign-key cascades reinforce the domain model below the TypeScript layer.","text_sha256":"54a000485a78366a0c7f5de194cc29ed033e2c9d0384021185966a7c6b62e851","unit_id":"s093","word_count":34},{"block_id":"repo-114-s093-b005","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s093","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":1075,"source_line_start":1075,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository also includes Cloudflare static-asset/Worker routing, D1 migration configuration, deployment scripts, and a GitHub Actions build. The latest commit''s workflow succeeds. Because the Wrangler D1 database ID remains a placeholder, the evidence supports a build-verified deployable scaffold rather than a claim of confirmed production deployment.","text_sha256":"f40df1fe8c5bcd40258a4d61e00e2ab01c5aee95d777403b1f9777176b99877e","unit_id":"s093","word_count":46},{"block_id":"repo-114-s093-b006","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s093","section_path":["Overall Repository Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Repository Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":1077,"source_line_start":1077,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository''s strongest signal is not size. It is disciplined generalization: encode the stable question-bank structure in the backend, keep book/chapter semantics at the naming layer, and use a separate versioned JSON transport format for portability.","text_sha256":"8cc169457566cbedfe0ea56f3031c84719d49489f56d0831da99a7af16b106ab","unit_id":"s093","word_count":36},{"block_id":"repo-114-s094-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s094","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":1083,"source_line_start":1083,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `question-bank-application`","text_sha256":"0bfc0993d2ef7cc986ae12ad0cde4a2fdc97029f5fcd87b7eb796136cf0ca44f","unit_id":"s094","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-114-s094-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s094","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":1084,"source_line_start":1084,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `study-tool`","text_sha256":"e02b98df0e9a74cf6c45056891a78bd737e6c5289caf47b6c2f31dc2628ebc09","unit_id":"s094","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-114-s094-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s094","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":1085,"source_line_start":1085,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `portable-content-application`","text_sha256":"eab3bf12e8d536cc4ac3f43e4b703ff1a682894a61706ed1d3fa2dc9ae184c19","unit_id":"s094","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-114-s094-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s094","section_path":["Project Type"],"section_title":"Project Type","source_file":"repositories/repo-114-KiroQuestionsBank/README.md","source_line_end":1086,"source_line_start":1086,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_fre