INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-115-rd005',115,'TransAct',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','architecture_system_design','positive','repository_specific',0.3935,21,210,'Section: Backend Layering

The Java source separates concerns into application-specific packages.

domain holds entities and state enumerations.

repo holds persistence access.

service contains transactional business rules.

api exposes HTTP controllers and response views.

config contains security and seeded development data.

db/migration contains Flyway schema history.

This structure keeps HTTP handling separate from transaction logic.

For example, project completion payment is not implemented as controller-side arithmetic.

The controller delegates into a service that validates actor identity, validates the deal state, performs a ledger transfer, changes the domain state, and records an audit event.

The same pattern appears in lending and recurring payment workflows.

Section: HTTP API Shape

The backend has controllers for:

health,

current user,

dashboard,

transfers,

project deals,

loans,

recurring salaries,

administrator loan review.

The controller split mirrors the main product workflows.

API view records are kept separately from persistence entities through ApiViews.

This provides a presentation boundary for HTTP responses.

Section: Build and Tooling > Backend Build Contract

The Maven project targets Java 21.

GitHub Actions executes:

mvn --batch-mode verify

This invokes the Maven verification lifecycle instead of compilation alone.

Section: Containerized Development Environment > Backend

The backend is built from ./backend.

Its environment receives JDBC connection information, CORS configuration, and the development user passwords.

It exposes port 8080.','["- java","flyway","cors","maven","backend","layering","http","shape","build","tooling","contract","containerized","development","environment"]','["Backend Layering","HTTP API Shape","Build and Tooling","Containerized Development Environment"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-115-s006-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s006","section_path":["Backend Layering"],"section_title":"Backend Layering","source_file":"repositories/repo-115-TransAct/README.md","source_line_end":150,"source_line_start":150,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The Java source separates concerns into application-specific packages.","text_sha256":"f7a8ef6e5e61f483110e0a9ac191869868a9e5d9a05e9417b48556df99d0b710","unit_id":"s006","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-115-s006-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s006","section_path":["Backend Layering"],"section_title":"Backend Layering","source_file":"repositories/repo-115-TransAct/README.md","source_line_end":152,"source_line_start":152,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"- `domain` holds entities and state enumerations.","text_sha256":"002568cc18df78036a32d45e3df7f0998eda04f86a180bbe1790420be1a04b16","unit_id":"s006","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-115-s006-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s006","section_path":["Backend Layering"],"section_title":"Backend Layering","source_file":"repositories/repo-115-TransAct/README.md","source_line_end":153,"source_line_start":153,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- `repo` holds persistence access.","text_sha256":"7368a2bc2dc219a9040979ba3480e19a99af900fb44f51bc72cd5e4e95ec9fa1","unit_id":"s006","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-115-s006-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","sec