115-TransAct/README.md","source_line_end":1190,"source_line_start":1190,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"T-score is a bounded explanation of platform-observed reliability.","text_sha256":"9c382a402af17083070f89508b66ac10923609c60d06ac4f44afc400ee392875","unit_id":"s107","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-115-s107-b012","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s107","section_path":["Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-115-TransAct/README.md","source_line_end":1198,"source_line_start":1198,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Instead, it gives the heuristic the same adapter shape that a later model-backed reviewer can implement, while preserving human approval and deterministic financial execution regardless of provider.","text_sha256":"22b6674c699d0cc50e0b040e15ff695880af16370f692b55fedf9375cb9e37f5","unit_id":"s107","word_count":27},{"block_id":"repo-115-s107-b013","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s107","section_path":["Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-115-TransAct/README.md","source_line_end":1200,"source_line_start":1200,"specificity_score":0.24,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"That architectural choice makes the repository useful evidence for backend domain modeling, financial-style accounting, safe decision-support boundaries, full-stack product organization, and CI-backed implementation discipline.","text_sha256":"c29bf19c04bc0798767dbdbf9fc4aa4ff0c8178b6b9b25fb3d9832b1b4692c58","unit_id":"s107","word_count":24},{"block_id":"repo-115-s107-b015","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s107","section_path":["Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Portfolio Significance","so