INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-116-rd006',116,'Learning.English',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3517,3,220,'Section: Markdown as the Learning Medium

The repository uses Markdown as the storage format.

Prompts, prose responses, tables, headings, separators, criterion tables, and notes all live in text files.

This makes the practice history easy to diff and version.

It also lets one file combine:

source task,

response,

evaluation,

revised evaluation,

notes,

resource links.

The repository therefore demonstrates a lightweight version-controlled learning-journal workflow.

Section: Iterative Practice Pattern

The history and file layout show a repeated cadence rather than a single isolated exercise.

The repository begins on September 25, 2023.

Its latest meaningful update is October 16, 2023.

Across that period, new day files are added and existing files are repeatedly updated.

The latest history contains several successive updates to day5.md.

Day 11 also has multiple update commits.

That commit pattern aligns with the content''s iterative-review structure.

Section: Learning Skills Demonstrated > Analytical Writing

selecting main features from data,

describing tables and chart-equivalent inputs,

identifying extremes,

comparing categories,

referring to averages,

summarizing quantitative relationships.

Section: Learning Skills Demonstrated > Argumentative Writing

introducing a social issue,

presenting more than one viewpoint,

supporting a position with examples,

concluding with a stated preference,

organizing ideas across paragraphs.

Section: Learning Skills Demonstrated > Writing Revision

preserving original attempts,

comparing first and later trials,

using criterion-level feedback,

revising grammar and vocabulary,

reviewing cohesion,

monitoring word count.','["markdown","learning","medium","iterative","practice","pattern","skills","demonstrated","analytical","writing","argumentative","revision"]','["Markdown as the Learning Medium","Iterative Practice Pattern","Learning Skills Demonstrated"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-116-s019-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s019","section_path":["Markdown as the Learning Medium"],"section_title":"Markdown as the Learning Medium","source_file":"repositories/repo-116-Learning.English/README.md","source_line_end":222,"source_line_start":222,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository uses Markdown as the storage format.","text_sha256":"35e4fca9949e8813ae308d668df12346ba36fc61e3fe50eaa57347358d82776c","unit_id":"s019","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-116-s019-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s019","section_path":["Markdown as the Learning Medium"],"section_title":"Markdown as the Learning Medium","source_file":"repositories/repo-116-Learning.English/README.md","source_line_end":224,"source_line_start":224,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Prompts, prose responses, tables, headings, separators, criterion tables, and notes all live in text files.","text_sha256":"b161e0d5fe81415235ef71133bae4ce36bb67f09a6cf9f0a8a522537335d7cf9","unit_id":"s019","word_count":15},{"block_id":"repo-116-s019-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s019","section_path":["Markdown as the Learning Medium"],"section_title":"Markdown as the Learning Medium","source_file":"repositories/repo-116-Learning.English/README.md","source_line_end":226,"source_line_start":226,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This makes the practice history easy to diff and version.","text_sha256":"bddc62f9f5cf8221e394d8f6c955d1546ef113ff