INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-118-rd002',118,'Security',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3814,21,245,'Section: What This Project Is

Security is a compact Python experiment around deterministic transformation of input text.

The repository contains a script named Password Hashing.py.

The script hashes input text with SHA-256.

That integer seeds Python''s pseudo-random generator.

The seeded generator then selects characters from a configured alphabet to produce a fixed-length output string.

The result is deterministic for a given input and output length because the same SHA-256 digest produces the same pseudo-random seed.

Section: Core Function

The script defines:

hash_text_to_alphanumeric(text, length=14)

The function takes arbitrary input text and an optional output length.

The default output length is 14 characters.

Its implementation has four main stages.

Encode the input text.

Compute a SHA-256 digest.

Seed the pseudo-random generator from the digest value.

Generate a string from the configured output alphabet.

This forms a reproducible text-to-string derivation pipeline.

Section: SHA-256 Digest Stage

The script uses Python''s standard hashlib module.

It creates a SHA-256 hash object from the UTF-8-encoded input text.

The digest is converted to hexadecimal representation.

The hexadecimal digest is then parsed as an integer.

This large integer becomes deterministic seed material for the next stage.

Section: Character Alphabet

The output alphabet combines:

uppercase ASCII letters,

lowercase ASCII letters,

decimal digits,

selected special characters.

The special-character set includes common punctuation used in password-style strings.

The generator therefore produces output that can contain multiple character classes.

Section: Deterministic Pseudo-Random Selection

The script calls:

random.seed(int(hex_dig, 16))

It then repeatedly calls random.choice over the configured character alphabet.','["- python","hashlib","hashing","core","function","sha-256","digest","stage","character","alphabet","deterministic","pseudo-random","selection"]','["What This Project Is","Core Function","SHA-256 Digest Stage","Character Alphabet","Deterministic Pseudo-Random Selection"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-118-s002-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s002","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-118-Security/README.md","source_line_end":19,"source_line_start":19,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Security` is a compact Python experiment around deterministic transformation of input text.","text_sha256":"e73b3d5cbc93a38c3762fdee00b2bac62269d2740d362a55392bd41660c53032","unit_id":"s002","word_count":12},{"block_id":"repo-118-s002-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":3,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s002","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-118-Security/README.md","source_line_end":21,"source_line_start":21,"specificity_score":0.65,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository contains a script named `Password Hashing.py`.","text_sha256":"73be68d8212f9440078cbd23395e3c0b5873190bb8db8fc2af359df7643902f8","unit_id":"s002","word_count":8},{"block_id":"repo-118-s002-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"methodology_or_interpretive","section_id":"s002","section_path":["What This Project Is"],"section_title":"What This Project Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-118-Security/README.md","source_line_end":23,"source_line_start":23,"specificity_score":0.28,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The script hashes input text with SHA-256.","text_sha256":"1e809c2930a3943a299f3c53d7bef6bf78f5e