Section: Portfolio Significance

This December 2024 repository is a historical marker for image-processing work in the portfolio.

It shows MATLAB being used not only for numerical scripts but also through the Live Editor''s integrated computational-document format.

The artifact''s value for RAG retrieval is precise and bounded: it supports queries about MATLAB, image processing, spatial filtering, and Live Script workflows.

It should be combined with later vision, sensor, and machine-learning repositories when answering broader questions about visual-data experience, while retaining the distinction that this repository itself is a focused spatial-filtering exercise.

