INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-121-rd006',121,'NetSeer',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3754,12,234,'Section: Copy-to-Clipboard Workflow

The code:

creates an offscreen canvas;

sizes it to the rendered chart;

paints a white background;

draws the chart canvas onto it;

converts the result to a PNG blob;

writes the blob through navigator.clipboard.write and ClipboardItem.

The explicit white-background step avoids a transparent canvas becoming visually unsuitable when pasted into a document with a different background.

The code reports success or failure through the page''s status component.

Section: PNG Export

The image-download path uses a similar offscreen-canvas approach.

The rendered chart is composited over white and converted to a PNG data URL.

A temporary anchor is assigned a mode-specific filename such as:

upload-speed-chart.png
download-speed-chart.png

and programmatically triggered.

Section: Processed CSV Export

The network processor creates a CSV with:

Time,CumulativeTime,Download (MB/s),Upload (MB/s)

Every parsed record is serialized into this normalized format.

A Blob is then handed to FileSaver.js.

The application therefore supports both visual output and machine-readable processed data.

Section: FTP Log Analyzer

ftp.html is a second, separately focused browser tool titled FTP Log Analyzer.

Its expected log shape is:

Transfer completed=1 seconds=670.199 bytes=1000000000

The analyzer extracts:

completion flag;

transfer duration;

transferred byte count.

It then turns repeated FTP-transfer log output into descriptive statistics and two chronological plots.

Section: FTP Entry Parsing

Each nonempty input line is examined for three regular-expression fields:

completed=
seconds=
bytes=

A record is accepted when all three are present.

Numeric strings are converted into JavaScript integer/float values.','["html","javascript","copy-to-clipboard","workflow","export","processed","analyzer","entry","parsing"]','["Copy-to-Clipboard Workflow","PNG Export","Processed CSV Export","FTP Log Analyzer","FTP Entry Parsing"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-121-s014-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s014","section_path":["Copy-to-Clipboard Workflow"],"section_title":"Copy-to-Clipboard Workflow","source_file":"repositories/repo-121-NetSeer/README.md","source_line_end":195,"source_line_start":195,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"The code:","text_sha256":"3dfb11e12132a8d9c100a0a49196ecc994160ac5aef332fdb41a5c1e36353271","unit_id":"s014","word_count":2},{"block_id":"repo-121-s014-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s014","section_path":["Copy-to-Clipboard Workflow"],"section_title":"Copy-to-Clipboard Workflow","source_file":"repositories/repo-121-NetSeer/README.md","source_line_end":197,"source_line_start":197,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"1. creates an offscreen canvas;","text_sha256":"2af877d386c2a1a5a8adeb407a7bb82e83ab7cd7cf12d14a7628f23bdbf887d3","unit_id":"s014","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-121-s014-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s014","section_path":["Copy-to-Clipboard Workflow"],"section_title":"Copy-to-Clipboard Workflow","source_file":"repositories/repo-121-NetSeer/README.md","source_line_end":198,"source_line_start":198,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"2. sizes it to the rendered chart;","text_sha256":"2dccc650b45aa2391faae72f767016763c44182211cc601b301de0f93053482f","unit_id":"s014","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-121-s014-b005","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":