INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-121-rd011',121,'NetSeer',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','interpretive',0.3368,7,253,'Section: Data-Processing Skills Demonstrated

duplicate removal;

completed-observation filtering;

mean and standard-deviation calculation;

derived throughput calculation;

chronological and sorted views.

Section: Visualization Skills Demonstrated

The repository shows:

time-series plotting;

dynamic metric selection;

dynamically computed labels;

tooltip formatting;

plot customization;

report-oriented chart export;

multiple coordinated plot types for the same experiment set.

Section: Network-Analysis Skills Demonstrated

The data models are tied directly to network experiments.

The application understands and transforms:

upload speed;

download speed;

FTP transfer completion;

transfer duration;

transferred bytes;

derived MB/s.

This makes NetSeer more specific than a generic CSV charting page.

Section: Engineering Practices Evidenced > Single-file portability

Each analyzer packages its UI and processing logic into one transportable HTML file.

Section: Engineering Practices Evidenced > Explicit validation feedback

Both tools validate the input before rendering results and surface useful error/status messages.

Section: Engineering Practices Evidenced > Presentation separated from parsed data

The main processor stores processedData and then derives chart state from it.

Mode switching and smoothing therefore do not require reparsing the raw logs.

Section: Engineering Practices Evidenced > Reusable derived-state functions

Moving average, chart update, export, status, and parsing are separated into named functions.

Section: Engineering Practices Evidenced > Output reuse

The project supports taking results into another workflow through:

clipboard image data;

PNG file;

CSV data.

Section: Portfolio Significance

NetSeer is evidence of building small tools around the actual friction of technical experimentation.

Instead of manually transforming network logs in a spreadsheet for each run, the repository encodes repeatable rules for parsing, normalizing, smoothing, comparing, and exporting measurements.','["html","standard-deviation","data-processing","skills","demonstrated","visualization","network-analysis","engineering","practices","evidenced","single-file","portability","validation","feedback","presentation","separated","from","parsed","data","reusable","derived-state","functions","output","reuse"]','["Data-Processing Skills Demonstrated","Visualization Skills Demonstrated","Network-Analysis Skills Demonstrated","Engineering Practices Evidenced","Portfolio Significance"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-121-s041-b008","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s041","section_path":["Data-Processing Skills Demonstrated"],"section_title":"Data-Processing Skills Demonstrated","source_file":"repositories/repo-121-NetSeer/README.md","source_line_end":458,"source_line_start":458,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- duplicate removal;","text_sha256":"a57acd20afbd9fbb22d568f0907bf58596caafffda1ecdedba3a5612464bfc59","unit_id":"s041","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-121-s041-b009","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s041","section_path":["Data-Processing Skills Demonstrated"],"section_title":"Data-Processing Skills Demonstrated","source_file":"repositories/repo-121-NetSeer/README.md","source_line_end":459,"source_line_start":459,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- completed-observation filtering;","text_sha256":"bfe4ed1e166da0aaba12d037fa8be2e492057d8ea94cc784814be3e273287829","unit_id":"s041","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-121-s041-b010","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s041","section_path":["Data-Processing Skills Demonstrated"],"section_title":"Data-Processing S