The repository is intentionally compact.

Its main files are:

README.md,

SceneDelegate.h,

SceneDelegate.m,

WhiteRaccoon.h,

WhiteRaccoon.m.

The WhiteRaccoon .m implementation is much larger than the application-shell files.

