INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-129-rd007',129,'Apple-Publication',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','performance_scale','positive','repository_specific',0.3628,9,119,'Section: Throughput Processing Page

Processing/Throughput.html is a browser-based network-log processor.

It uses:

Chart.js,

Moment.js,

FileSaver.js.

The page includes a substantial interactive UI for:

log input,

processing,

plotting,

configurable display,

chart export.

Section: Throughput Processing Page > Plot Controls

The page contains:

upload/download views,

moving-window controls,

chart colors,

editable chart titles,

marker controls.

The marker UI indicates later extension beyond the earlier NetSeer throughput processor.

Section: Throughput Processing Page > Browser-Based Workflow

Keeping this processor as standalone HTML makes it easy to use on experiment outputs without starting an application server.

This pattern appears repeatedly across the research portfolio.

Section: Scale and Complexity

a ~51 KB FTP automation client,

