,"text":"- repeated-transfer automation,","text_sha256":"4b7c8fd0bacde7c0258d2798c8e8e9c7ec231c6afb16883aeb39b874ce0e1546","unit_id":"s052","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-129-s052-b005","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s052","section_path":["Historical Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","source_line_end":562,"source_line_start":562,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- UDP control,","text_sha256":"5453ee64e7488c70939e9cf538691c2dd12274c385ab4f1aeee3c404ba8a001f","unit_id":"s052","word_count":3},{"block_id":"repo-129-s052-b006","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s052","section_path":["Historical Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","source_line_end":563,"source_line_start":563,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"- browser log processing.","text_sha256":"90b67ff5f0295ff0fd27c59a83607e8577fbce72fddc7c777308c0e9e5bde4d1","unit_id":"s052","word_count":4},{"block_id":"repo-129-s052-b007","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s052","section_path":["Historical Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","source_line_end":565,"source_line_start":565,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"This repository carries those pieces forward and adds a higher-level experiment language plus transport-layer analysis.","text_sha256":"9c5e8ca138e12bdf20f5765ac3f4a281f7d9b1f8bef1388b683f6d5194355619","unit_id":"s052","word_count":15},{"block_id":"repo-129-s052-b008","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s052","section_path":["Historical Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","source_line_end":567,"source_line_start":567,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"The evolution is therefore:","text_sha256":"0dbd882484ca0d4e6dba872d76791b6b26f9dec8d3c4714ca1e5bd26e7f1f919","unit_id":"s052","word_count":4},{"block_id":"repo-129-s052-b010","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s052","section_path":["Historical Portfolio Significance"],"section_title":"Historical Portfolio Significance","source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","source_line_end":579,"source_line_start":579,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"That is stronger evidence of engineering progression than treating the repository as an isolated set of scripts.","text_sha256":"3cdbfdac3d0b01c5778ff5e8823543ba5552ce7c6565b3eedcdc09606a474317","unit_id":"s052","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-129-s053-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s053","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","source_line_end":583,"source_line_start":583,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`Apple-Publication` is a research publication toolkit that composes earlier network-testing infrastructure with new automation and analysis layers.","text_sha256":"1a47aeadac9fcb9e76b550e9918c6d8c268dd52dcb7306ee29fdecc626175a19","unit_id":"s053","word_count":17},{"block_id":"repo-129-s053-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s053","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","source_line_end":585,"source_line_start":585,"specificity_score":0.38,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Its distinctive additions are the Net++ iperf3 suite language and the TCP ramp/doubling visualizer.","text_sha256":"dfda857dd06c84b5d03636b16c0c8a369d75470907fb54fcdea984b3ec62e544","unit_id":"s053","word_count":14},{"block_id":"repo-129-s053-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s053","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","source_line_end":587,"source_line_start":587,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Together they show a move toward experiments that are both declaratively reproducible and transport-layer interpretable.","text_sha256":"39d4e3e8c95696ba016d9df28c6f2981bf90c3c27ce863e6a4d0f912f7a9cc85","unit_id":"s053","word_count":15},{"block_id":"repo-129-s053-b004","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s053","section_path":["Overall Project Narrative"],"section_title":"Overall Project Narrative","source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","source_line_end":589,"source_line_start":589,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository also provides unusually clear evidence of code reuse across the portfolio, which is preserved here so later RAG answers can distinguish extension from repeated attribution.","text_sha256":"8f769b158ef5e813208907f4604aeaeade4159e8e08595202cabd53d5ab98203","unit_id":"s053","word_count":27}]','{"analysis_source_file":"repositories/repo-129-Apple-Publication/README.md","document_text_sha256":"dfa623adff76f4a3d4ef20522a974be14a91eef3218a0c01c4916cf543dc4078","earliest_source_line":516,"embedding_text_sha256":"6a4cb884b510f3e2506f48750ed9d868167292802a34454b66dfc97e6b891a5a","nor