INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-130-rd006',130,'LogicApp',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.3552,4,275,'Section: Email Notification Flow

Office 365 is used through a managed API connection.

The workflow composes high-importance water-leak email messages from resolved client and sensor information.

The content includes contextual location information and the triggering sensor identifier.

Email therefore occurs after data enrichment, not directly from the raw queue payload.

This sequence reduces the amount of business metadata that must be encoded in the device event itself.

Section: Linked-User Notification Flow

The SQL query against linkedUser supports notification of additional users associated with the client.

The workflow uses iteration to deliver notifications across the returned recipient set.

This shows explicit fan-out behavior inside the workflow.

Section: SMS Notification Flow

Twilio is used through a managed connector for SMS delivery.

The normal branch resolves the client contact and sends a leak alert containing relevant sensor-location context.

The connector is external; the repository''s engineering evidence is the conditional routing and data composition around it.

Section: Special Institutional Routing

The workflow contains a special branch triggered by client data matching an institutional marker.

In this path it:

reads rows from an Excel Online Business workbook;

iterates over those rows;

extracts recipient numbers;

sends leak-notification SMS messages through Twilio;

terminates the branch after the fan-out completes.

This is a distinct routing strategy from the normal single-client-contact SMS path.

It demonstrates support for recipient lists maintained outside the primary SQL schema.

Section: Excel Online Integration

Excel Online Business acts as an operational recipient source for the special branch.

The workflow therefore combines:

transactional SQL data;

queue event data;

spreadsheet-maintained recipient data.

This is characteristic of business integration systems where not every operational data set is controlled by one application database.','["email","notification","flow","linked-user","special","institutional","routing","excel","online","integration"]','["Email Notification Flow","Linked-User Notification Flow","SMS Notification Flow","Special Institutional Routing","Excel Online Integration"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-130-s018-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s018","section_path":["Email Notification Flow"],"section_title":"Email Notification Flow","source_file":"repositories/repo-130-LogicApp/README.md","source_line_end":251,"source_line_start":251,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"Office 365 is used through a managed API connection.","text_sha256":"d076ea9154648bcbf932fbab10d4328a228d3c1107c55b965ac72cb5d4bb5270","unit_id":"s018","word_count":9},{"block_id":"repo-130-s018-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s018","section_path":["Email Notification Flow"],"section_title":"Email Notification Flow","source_file":"repositories/repo-130-LogicApp/README.md","source_line_end":253,"source_line_start":253,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The workflow composes high-importance water-leak email messages from resolved client and sensor information.","text_sha256":"fca0255cc7b0ff5316f329683a751b735bc8cc9f4f9c88455c342fa82df93ff4","unit_id":"s018","word_count":13},{"block_id":"repo-130-s018-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s018","section_path":["Email Notification Flow"],"section_title":"Email Notification Flow","source_file":"repositories/repo-130-LogicApp/README.md","source_line_end":255,"source_line_start":255,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The content includes contextual location information