INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-132-rd002',132,'LInC-Church-Management',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','other_repository_evidence','positive','repository_specific',0.386,8,194,'Section: What This Repository Is

LInC-Church-Management is the source repository for LInC One, a large bilingual ministry-management platform.

It is not a single-purpose church calendar or form application.

The current codebase spans:

public ministry-facing pages;

authentication and canonical identity;

protected capability routing;

Pastor scheduling and booking;

People Notes;

People Development;

assessment forms;

Ministry operations;

Mission Trips;

Servant Management;

Discipleship;

attendance;

public Library resources;

support ticketing;

administrator governance;

server-side AI assistants;

transactional email;

object storage;

abuse controls;

production observability;

CI/CD and E2E verification;

a separate commit-synchronized AI-context research system.

This is one of the broadest product-engineering repositories in the portfolio corpus.

Section: Current Production Surfaces

The root README documents two independent production surfaces:

Frontend: lincministry.com, hosted on Netlify.
Backend: Cloudflare Worker at the LInC backend workers.dev endpoint.

The repository explicitly treats frontend and backend deployment as separate systems.

A successful frontend deployment is not assumed to mean the Worker was deployed, and vice versa.

This distinction is reinforced by separate production-smoke workflows.

Section: Access Activation and Suspension

Canonical application access has explicit state rather than being inferred only from the existence of a Firebase account.

The platform supports governance around:

account activation;

suspension;

identity reconciliation;','["ministry-management","netlify","discipleship","production","surfaces","access","activation","suspension"]','["What This Repository Is","Current Production Surfaces","Access Activation and Suspension"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-132-s002-b001","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":2,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s002","section_path":["What This Repository Is"],"section_title":"What This Repository Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-132-LInC-Church-Management/README.md","source_line_end":18,"source_line_start":18,"specificity_score":0.58,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"`LInC-Church-Management` is the source repository for **LInC One**, a large bilingual ministry-management platform.","text_sha256":"e51f1be9a9496c1a073aa39e33820ae4b9ce15775c0a1452bbcee7f50846756e","unit_id":"s002","word_count":13},{"block_id":"repo-132-s002-b002","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s002","section_path":["What This Repository Is"],"section_title":"What This Repository Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-132-LInC-Church-Management/README.md","source_line_end":20,"source_line_start":20,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"It is not a single-purpose church calendar or form application.","text_sha256":"d798947d51612cf3abe56c85d49e64022f93c6e7af9a79eafcce84658cdb90d3","unit_id":"s002","word_count":10},{"block_id":"repo-132-s002-b003","canonical_categories":[],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s002","section_path":["What This Repository Is"],"section_title":"What This Repository Is","source_file":"repositories/repo-132-LInC-Church-Management/README.md","source_line_end":22,"source_line_start":22,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"The current codebase spans:","text_sha256":"01d1c356ba70c87d4831f8d06495a3fc0239dfa2adcf565f6116ba9595a3e647","unit_id":"s002","word_count":4},{"block_id":