INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-132-rd007',132,'LInC-Church-Management',NULL,NULL,'direct_evidence','identity_access_security','positive','repository_specific',0.3692,5,208,'Section: Authentication Is Not Authorization

The repository states this explicitly and repeatedly.

Firebase Authentication establishes authenticated identity.

Application authority is determined later from canonical identity and domain policy.

A successful login therefore does not automatically grant:

Pastor access;

administrator authority;

Spiritual Program participation;

Ministry authority;

service membership;

Discipleship teaching authority;

support-desk authority.

This is one of the strongest architectural themes in the project.

Section: Rate Limiting Is Not Authorization

The repository explicitly keeps abuse mitigation separate from business validation.

Rate limiting protects exposed endpoints from excessive use.

It does not decide whether a business operation is valid.

Section: Security Programme

docs/security/ contains dedicated security/threat-modelling work.

Security boundaries described in the root README include:

authentication vs authorization;

public endpoint validation;

confidential Pastor data;

bounded AI context;

provider credentials;

recipient privacy;

object-storage signing;

deletion/audit behavior.

Section: Privacy Boundaries

The product contains human/ministry information, so authorization is intentionally domain specific.

Examples include:

People Notes restricted to Pastor authority;

administrator capability not implying universal pastoral access;

recipient-scoped service files;

location-scoped Discipleship authority;

public support projections separated from staff operations.

Section: Email Privacy

The documentation differentiates group BCC-style messaging from individualized confidential delivery.

It also prefers server-generated templates over arbitrary browser-provided HTML.

Section: Object-Storage Security

B2 provider credentials stay on the Worker side.','["discipleship","authentication","authorization","rate","limiting","security","programme","privacy","boundaries","email","object-storage"]','["Authentication Is Not Authorization","Rate Limiting Is Not Authorization","Security Programme","Privacy Boundaries","Email Privacy","Object-Storage Security"]','[]','[{"block_id":"repo-132-s009-b001","canonical_categories":["security_privacy"],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s009","section_path":["Authentication Is Not Authorization"],"section_title":"Authentication Is Not Authorization","source_file":"repositories/repo-132-LInC-Church-Management/README.md","source_line_end":185,"source_line_start":185,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_repository_frequency":1,"text":"The repository states this explicitly and repeatedly.","text_sha256":"fe5cef8dabdd294cb82a17297347cde94057d0a30364ac5f429b7e4d480e4677","unit_id":"s009","word_count":7},{"block_id":"repo-132-s009-b002","canonical_categories":["security_privacy"],"concrete_hits":1,"evidence_level":"repository_specific","section_id":"s009","section_path":["Authentication Is Not Authorization"],"section_title":"Authentication Is Not Authorization","source_file":"repositories/repo-132-LInC-Church-Management/README.md","source_line_end":187,"source_line_start":187,"specificity_score":0.57,"template_repository_frequency":0,"text":"Firebase Authentication establishes authenticated identity.","text_sha256":"e55699a31a7e6a265ebd48a0dac988255d7951d07ab7fc781814a87cce741f57","unit_id":"s009","word_count":5},{"block_id":"repo-132-s009-b003","canonical_categories":["security_privacy"],"concrete_hits":0,"evidence_level":"interpretive","section_id":"s009","section_path":["Authentication Is Not Authorization"],"section_title":"Authentication Is Not Authorization","source_file":"repositories/repo-132-LInC-Church-Management/README.md","source_line_end":189,"source_line_start":189,"specificity_score":0.34,"template_