INSERT INTO rag_documents (document_id,repository_index,repository_name,repository_slug,repository_url,retrieval_class,semantic_area,evidence_polarity,evidence_level,specificity_score,concrete_signal_count,word_count,text,topics_json,evidence_areas_json,related_skill_ratings_json,source_fragments_json,provenance_json) VALUES ('repo-132-rd023',132,'LInC-Church-Management',NULL,NULL,'interpretation','testing_quality','neutral','repository_specific',0.4199,7,105,'Section: Playwright E2E

The repository contains an isolated e2e/ project using Playwright.

The CI E2E workflow:

installs locked dependencies;

installs Chromium and Linux dependencies;

runs public/anonymous scenarios;

retains reports;

retains failure artifacts.

Section: Protected-Route E2E

The anonymous protected-route suite checks that a visitor:

remains on the requested path;

sees the shared login gateway;

preserves the capability being requested.

That verifies product-level access UX rather than only component rendering.

Section: Test Environment Isolation

